<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">2 Khangthute</book>
  <para style="h">2 Khangthute</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Khangthute</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Khangthute</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Khangthute</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David tapa Solomon khu aleenggam ah suhhat in a um a, Mangpa a Pasian in aumpi a, tualeh nasatah a thupi in abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Israelmi zousie kungah leh atul tunga lamkaite aza tunga lamkaite leh vaihawmte leh Israel lamkaite zousie leh aphungsung ua upate kungah, thu agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon leh mipi kikhawmte zousie, Gibeon khuo aum mun sang ah ahaw ua, khunah Mangpa suohpa Mosi in gamdai a ana bawl kimutuona biehbuh aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian bawm khu David in Kiriath-Jearim akipat in aman akoina dinga abawlna mun ah ala touta hi, aziehpen aman akoina dingin Jerusalem ah puoninn ana zah zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Hur tapa Huri tapa Bezalel in ana bawl sum-eng maitam khu Gibeon khuo a, Mangpa biehbuh mai ah aum a, tuachi’n Solomon leh mipi kikhawmten khunah Pasian ava bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomon khu kimutuona biehbuh aum, Mangpa mai a sum-eng maitam lam ah apeitou a, halmang sillat tul khat alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum zan in Solomon kungah, Pasian ava kilah a, akungah, “Bang ahiei kang pieh ding? hing ngen in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khumin Solomon in Pasian kungah, “Kapa David kungah hepina thupitah na langsah a, tualeh ama thahengin leengpa in kei na hing pang sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin aw Mangpa Pasian, ka pa David kunga na thuchiem sukipin um hen, aziehpen leitunga a leivui za atam mipite tungah leengpa in na hing pang sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi te masanga pawt leh lut a ka um theina dingin pilna leh theina hing piein, na mi tamzapite tungah koi in ahiei vaihawm pieh thei ding?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in Solomon kungah, “Tambang lungsim na puoha, neilelamte leh hausatnate pahtawinate, ahisihleh na melmate hinna ngenlou a, damsawtnate zong ngenlou a, atung ua leengpa a ka hing pansahna mipite vaihahawm pieh theina dinga, pilna leh theinate na hing nget zawh ziehin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pilna leh theina pieh nahita hi, tualeh nang masanga leengten zong ana nei ngailou uh tualeh nang nua a leengte koiman zong anei ngailou ding uh, sumlepai leh hausatnate, pahtawinate ka hing piehbe nalai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon khu Gibeon khuo a munsang mai aum kimutuona biehbuh akipat in Jerusalem ah ahing pei a, Israelte tungah vai ahawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon in sakollengte leh sakoltung tuongmite akhawm khawma, tualeh sakolleng tul khat leh zali tualeh sakol tungtuongmi tul sawm leh tul ni anei a, tuate sakolleng koina khopite ah leh Jerusalem a leengpa kungah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n dangka sia leh sana Jerusalem ah suong bang mai a tam in akoi a, tualeh sidar sing lah phaijanga theipi sing banga tam in akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon in sakolte Izipt gam leh Kue gam a kipata alah lut ahia, leengpa summet bawlmiten Kue akipat ava lei zel uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Izipt gam akipat sakolleng khat ah dangka shekel zaguh leh sakol khat ah dangka shekel za leh sawmnga a lei in ahing tawllut ua, tuabangmain Hitmite leengte leh Siria leengte kungah atawlpawt zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Mangpa min a dingin biehinn khat, tualeh ama dingin leeng innpi khat lam asawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon in vanpawding mi tul sawm sagi leh singtang gam a suong kalkhe dingin mi tul sawm giet tualeh amahaw veng ding mi tul thum leh zaguh ateldoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Tai-ar leengpa Huram kungah, mi asawl a, akungah “Ka pa David tenna ding inn lamna dinga Sidar sing na tuoh pieh bangin kei zong hing tuoh pieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai vawi, khawlnite a, hathate a leh Mangpa ka Pasian uh pawi bawl nite a, amasanga gimnamtui hal a, tanghou siengthou koi ngitnget a, tualeh zingmawng leh nitahlam a halmang sillatte latna dingin, Mangpa ka Pasian min adingin inn khat ka lam ding hi. Tami Israelte adinga kumtawm a dinga thugousie ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Koute Pasian pen pasien dangte zousie sanga thupi zaw ahiman in ka biehinn lamding khu athupi mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh ama lah vante leh vansangpen in zong dawlzoulou ahiman in, koi adiei ama dinga inn lampieh zou ding? Amasanga gimnamtui halna munding bep loungal, kei koi ka hia Ama inn lampieh ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Juda gam leh Jerusalem a mi khutsiemte, ka pa David in ana zahsa tua ka kunga umte toh sem khawm dingin, Sana, dangka sia, sum-eng leh sia khensiem leh khuoh siem tualeh puon sandup, san au leh adum gan siem mikhat hing sawlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lebanon a Sidar singte, taa singte leh algum singtunte zong hing hah in, na mite Lebanon a sing sat dan asiem uh chi ka thei hi, tuachi’n ka miten na mite toh asem khawm ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sing tampi ahing khol pieh ding uhi, aziehpen ka biehinn lamding khu lien leh thupi mama ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai vawi, na mi singsatte leh singbawl mite, mangbu Kor tul sawmni, mimbu kor tul sawmni, uoin bath tul sawmni leh Olive thau bath sawmni, ka pe ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Tai-ar leengpa Huram in laihahin tambangin Solomon adawng hi: “Mangpa’n amite a it zieh a, nang amaute leengpa a ahing bawl ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ban ah tambangin agenbe nalai hi; “Lei leh van siempa Mangpa Israelte Pasian phat in um hen, Aman leengpa David kungah, tapa pil, lungsimpilna leh sil theikah siemna nei apie a, aman Mangpa adingin biehinn leh ama tenna ding leeng innpi lam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Khutsiem mama Huram Abi na kung ah kang sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anu Dan mi ahi a, apa pen Tai-ar mi ahi. Amapen sana, dangka, sum-eng leh sia, tualeh sing leh suong leh puon sandup, ausan leh dum leh puonmalngat te bawldan kizil siemsa ahi. Ama khu akhuohthaw chituom tuom zong siemsa ahi a, alim gelsa a kipie bangbanga bawl theimi ahi. Na mi khutsiemte leh napa ka pu David mi siemte toh asemkhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin ka pu in na chiemsa, mangbu mim bu, Olive thau tualeh uointe na suohpa kungah hing hahta in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tualeh kouten na tulmaw za za Lebanon muol a singte ka hing sat ding ua, tualeh Joppa dong tuipi tungah pum in ka hing tawl suh ding ua, tuachi’n nang Jerusalem ah na potou ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Solomon in, apa David in mi simna abawl zou nua a, Israel gam a gamdang mi hing um thate zousie asim a, tul za khat leh tul sawm nga leh tul thum leh zaguh apha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuate lah ah van paw ding mi tul sawm sagi, muola suong toukhe ding mi tul sawmgiet asep a, amaute nasep entup dingin mi tul thum leh zaguh aguot nalai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Jerusalem a Moria muol tungah, apa David kunga Mangpa kilahna, Jebusmi Ornan phuol a David mun bawlkholna ah Mangpa inn abawl panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in avaihawm kum, kum lina, aha lina, ani ni niin innlam apanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in Pasian biehinn lamna dinga, suongphum abawl khu, tong sawm guh a sau, tong sawmni a lien ahi. (Tua khu tena lui a kite ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biehinn mailam innhim khu innpi vailam mabangin tong sawmni a sau ahia, tong sawmni a sang ahi. Asunglam sana siengset tuiin aluonkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Innsung lienzawpen bangte tasing peh in athuopa, tua khu sana siengset tui in aluonkhum a, tum sing leh khainieng limte in azem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman tua biehinn khu akilawmna dingin suongmantamte in azem a, tuana azah sanate khu Parvaim sana ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atung dalna innkamte, kotbiengte leh biehinn bangte sana tuiin aluonkhum a, bangte ah cherubim limte akhuoh thawin agiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman mun siengthoupen abawl a, asaulam khu biehinn vailam toh kikim ahia, tong sawmni ahi, tualeh availam zong tong sawmni ma ahia, sana siengset talent za guhin aluonkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sana innkilnate khu Shekel sawmnga agih ahia, atunglam teng zong sana a luonkhum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua mun siengthou pen ah, Cherubim limni abawla, sana in aluon khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua Cherubimte hate gel saudan tong sawmni ahia, Cherubim khat ha langkhat saudan tong nga ahia, ainn bang langkhat asukha hi, tualeh aha langkhat saudan zong tong nga ma ahi a, Cherubim dang khat pen ha toh aki sutuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuamabangin Cherubim dang khatpen ha lang khat tong nga ma ahi a, ainnbang langkhat asupha hi, tualeh aha lang khat zong tongnga ma ahi a, Cherubim khatpen ha toh aki sutuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam Cherubim tegel ha khu tong sawmni huopin akizah a, innsunglam ngain akengun ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh puonjah dingin, adum, asandup leh asan au leh puon malngatte abawl a, Cherubim limte atuongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biehinn mailam ah tong sawm thum leh tong nga a sang khuompi ni aphut a, tua khuomtegel adawn zum khu tongnga tuoh tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua khuom dawnte ah khainieng kiphante aviel a, tualeh kawlbuthei zakhat abawla, Khainiengte ah akhai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuompite gel biehinn mailam ah aphut a, khat simlamah, khatpen mallam ah aphut hi, simlam tapen min Jakin ahisah a, mallam tapen min Boaz ahisah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuathamlouin ama’n sum-eng maitam khat tong sawmni a sau, tong sawmni ma a lien leh tong sawm a sang abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman sia kisunthaw in tuikuongpi khat abem in abawl a, agei leh agei kikaal tong sawm ahia, asan lam tong nga ahi, tualeh agei kimvel a te-in tong sawmthum apha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh nuoi lam kimvel ah bawngtal lim ngen in a imkuol a, tongkhat sungah sawm zel aum a, tua bawngtal limte, guolni in tuikuongpi toh sunkhawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua tuikuongpi khu bawngtal sawmleni tungah akitung a, thum in tumlam anga a, thum in mallam anga a, thum in simlam, tualeh thum in suolam anga hi. Tuikuongpi khu atung uah akinga a, alailam anua ngat chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua tuikuongpi khu khutpeh chia in asa a, agei zong nou gei bang ahia, lilipah pal bang ahi a, tualeh tuikuongpi in bath tul thum adawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman khut silna dingin kuongdai sawm abawla, simlam pangah nga tualeh mallam pangah nga akoi hi. Tuate halmang sillat dingte silsiengna in akizang hi. Hinanleh tuikuongpi pen siemputen kisilna a azah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman abawl dan ding a kiguongsa dungzui in sana thaumei tunna sawm abawl a, simlampang ah nga, tualeh mallampangah nga akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman dawkan sawm zong abawla, bieh innsung ah, simlam ah nga tualeh mallam ah nga, akoi hi. Tualeh aman sana hengkuong zakhat zong abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman siempute huongsung inntuol abawl a, huongsung lien leh akotkhate abawl a, akotkhate sum-eng in aluonkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuikuongpi pen simlampang, sim suo lam ning zietlam ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman belte, vutluohnate, hengkuongte zong abawl hi. Tuachi’n Huram-Abi in leengpa Solomon dinga Pasian biehinn sunga van ding, abawl pieh dingte zousie abawl zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuompi nite, dawna nou bemte leh khuompi nite dawnna belkuong lukhuzum bangte zepna khainieng kiphan nite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua khainieng kiphan nite tunga kolbuthei zalite, tualeh tua khuom nite dawn a belkuong banga kibawl khuom lukhute zepna khainieng kiphante a kikoi kawlbuthei guolnite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Atunnate leh kuong daite, abawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuikuongpi leh anuoi a bawngtal sawm leh nite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Belte, vutluohnate, sa lepna sia khutkate leh akisaipi vandangte zousie abawl hi. Mangpa biehinn a dinga, Huram-Abi in, Solomon a dinga abawlpieh van zousie sum-eng tesitset in abawl pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuate zousie Jordan phaijang ah Sukoth leh Jeredathah kikaal a bellei munah leengpa’n asung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Solomon in abawl tam vante zousie atam sengseng a, sum-eng gihdan a kite seng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Solomon in Pasian biehinn sunga vanjah ding, sana maitam, tanghou sieng koina dawkan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Akiguotsa banga mun siengthou sungnung masanga det ding, meivah tunna leh ameivahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sana pahlim leh meivahte leh taite, sana siengset a bawl ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sana siengseta kibawl thau mei eeh tetannate, maiphiet na kuongte, gimnamtui halna hengkuongte, tualeh biehinn kotkhate, Mun Siengthou pen kotkha sungnung leh innsungpi a kotkhate sana a kibawl ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in Mangpa biehinn dinga, anasep zousie azawtahin, apa David in ana latsa silte: dangka, sana leh vanjahte zousie, ala lut a, Pasian biehinn a gou koikhawmna ah, akoilut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Israel upate leh nam chin a lamkaite tualeh Israel innkuonte lah a alutang pente uh, David khopi Zion a kipat a Mangpa thuhun bawm latou dingin Jerusalem ah ahankhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelmite zousie, hasagina pawi bawlna hunin leengpa kungah ahing peikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel upate zousie ahing tun tahun, Leviten Pasian bawm akipat ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tualeh amaun, bawm leh kimutuona biehbuh leh biehinn sunga um leh bel vanjah siengthou um zousie apotou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lengpa Solomon leh Israel mipi kikhawm, ama kunga hing kikhawm zousie bawm maiah aum ua, belamte leh bawngtalte sim senglou a tam in akithoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n siemputen Mangpa thuhun bawm khu biehinn sunga munsiengthou sungnunga, Mun siengthou pen mun a, ama koina ding mun a, cherubimte gel halim nuoi ah ahing polutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua cherubimte gelin bawm umna mun khu aha un azah khum ua, tua bawm leh azawnna zawlte akhu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam zawlte asau mama a, bawm akipat a aval hingdohkhie munsiengthou sungnung mai apat in akimuthei a, Munsiengthou pen pulam apat in vang akimu thei sih hi. Tuni dongin tua zawlte tua munah aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izipt akipat a ahing pawtdoh lai ua, Mangpa’n Israel tate toh Horeb muola thuhun abawl lai a Mosi in tua bawm sunga akoi suongpeh nite chiloungal, Pasian bawm sungah bangma dang aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, mun siengthou pen akipat siempute ahing pawtkhieh tah un. Tua mun a um siempute zousie koima pawl tuom umlou in akisusiengthou chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tumging tum Levite zousie, Asaph, Heman leh Jeduthun te leh atapate u’leh aunaute uh, puonmalngat sil in, dahkhutbehte, kaigingte leh pehgingte tum in maitam suolampang ah ading uhi. Siempu za leh sawmni in zong pengkul mut in amaute adinpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pengkul mutte leh lasate Mangpa phat ding leh Ama tunga kipah thu gen dingin, aw khat suoin apangkhawm uhi. Pengkul te, dahkhutbehte leh tumging dangte thuo in, Mangpa phat a aw ngaitah suo in, “Ama ahoi hi; Aitna kumtawn in aum ding hi,” chia Mangpa phat a la asah tahun, Mangpa biehinn khu meilum in ahing tuomdimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua meilum ziehin siemputen anasep ding uh asem theita sih uhi, aziehpen Mangpa thupina in Pasian biehinn aluo dimta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in “Mangpa’n meipi miel keei kuui lah a um ding kahi, ana chi zouta hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ken kumtawna na tendenna dingin biehinn thupitah ka hing lampiehta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua mun a Israel mipi kikhawmte adin lai un leengpa ahing kihei a, amaute aguolzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman, “Kapa David kungah akam in thu ana chiem a, akhut mama a sutangtungpa Mangpa Israelte Pasian phat in umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman: Izipt gam a kipata ka mite ka puidoh akipat ka min umna dinga biehinn lamna ding mun leh Israel nam lah a khopi khat zong ka tel nai sih a, ka mi Israelte tunga lamkai ding zong koima ka tel naishi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tu’n ka min umna dingin Jerusalem ka telta a, ka mi Israelte tunga vaihawm dingin David ka telta, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pa David in Mangpa Israelte Pasian min a dingin biehinn khat lampieh ding alung gul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n ka pa David kungah, ka min a dinga biehinn khat lam ding nana lunggul a, tambang lungsim na nei ahoi ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanlezong nangman tua biehinn na lamsih dinga, na tahsa leh sisan mama a pieng na tapain ka min adingin tua inn khu alam zaw ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n athuchiemsate atudet a, tuin ka pa David thahengin, Mangpa’n ana chiemsa mabangin Israelte leengtoupha tungah ka touta a, Israelte Mangpa Pasian min dingin biehinn ka lamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khunah Pasian bawm ka koi a, tua bawm sungah Mangpa’n Israel mite toh kaal a thuhun abawl aum hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mipi kikhawmte masanga Mangpa maitam mai ah Solomon adinga aban azah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon in sum-eng dawkang, tong nga asau, tongnga alien leh tong thum a sang abawla huongsung inntuol pulam tazawpen laikim tahah akoi a, ama tua dawkang tungah adinga, tuachi’n Israel mipi kikhawmte mai ah akhup din a, vanlam ah akhut azahtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama athum a: “Aw Mangpa Israelte Pasian leitung leh vantungah nangma bang Pasian aum sih hi. Lungtang zousie toh na lampite zui a gamta, na suohte toh kikaal a itna thuhun hung Pasian dang aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na suoh ka pa David kunga na thuchiem, na tangtung sah a, tualeh na kam in thu nana chiem a na khut ngelin na sutangtung hi, tuni mabangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin Mangpa Israelte Pasian aw, na suohpa ka pa David kunga, nahah na suonte, nang um banga um dinga, agamtat dan ua apilvang pou u’leh, ka mitmu ah Israelte leengtoupha a tou ding akitasam sih ding, chia na kichiemna khu tangtung sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa Israelte Pasian aw, na suoh David kunga, na thuchiem khu, tuin hing sutangtung teitei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hinanleh Pasian leitunga mihingte toh atengkhawm tahtah talawm ding adiei? van leh van sangpente nangawnin nang hing dawllou hi a, tam ka biehinn lam in, hing dawlzou maw va-ia samva e maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa Pasian na suoh thumna leh zangaina anget hing ngaikhieh pieh inlen, na masanga na suoh kikouna leh thumna ngaipieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sun leh zan in tami biehinn, ka min a um ding na china mun lam na mit in hing en zing hen. Tam mun lam nga a na suoh thumna na ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na suohpa leh Israel na mi Israelte tam munlam nga a, athum chiengun, athumna ngetnate uh na na za inlen, Na tenna mun vantunga apat in na ngaikhie inlen, na zah chiengin, ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi khat in a innveng tunga sil asuhkhiel zieh a, kichiemna neisah akiphatmaw a, tam biehinn maitam mai ahing zot chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vantunga pat na ngaikhie inlen thukhen in. Na suohte kikaal ah nangman thu khen inlen, mikhielte, akhelna uh ama lutungah tusah inlen mawpai in, tualeh mawna neilou mi khu mawnaneilou ahidan phuong inlen, adihna uh kilang sahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na mi Israelte na tunga akhel zieh ua, a gal lel ua, chimaw a hing kinuahei a na min loua tami biehinn a athum ua, ahing nget chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vantunga kipat na ngaikhie inlen, na mi Israelte khelna ngaidam inlen, amauleh apu apate uh kunga na piehsa gam ah puilut kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Na mite na tunga akhelna zieh ua, vante akikhabinga guo azuhlou chienga, akhelna zieh ua amauh na suh gentheina zieh a, tammun lam nga a, ahing thum ua, na min ahing law ua, akhelnate uh kisia a ahing kinua heikia chieng un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Van a kipat na ngaikhie inlen, na suohte, na mi Israelte khelna ngaidam in. Hindan lampi dih amaute zuiding hil inlen, goutan dinga na mite na piehna gam ah guo zusahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Gam sunga kiel ahiei, natna hipi ahiei, gawtna ahiei, muotna ahiei, khauphete ahiei, khaukhupte ahiei, ahing tun chieng ahiei, ahisihleh amelmate un akhopite uh alu ua, aimkhum chieng ua, bangchibang hasatna ahiei, ahisihleh natna ahiei, atuoh chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na mi Israelte khat poupou in agentheinate uh leh anatnate uh hing kiphawhdoh a, Tami biehinn lam nga a, akhut uh zah a thumna leh thungetna ahing tut chieng un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuabang hunchiengin, na umna van a kipat in na ngaikhie inlen, ngaidam in, mi chin lungtang nang na thei a, anasep dan dungzui un thukhen piehin, aziehpen nang bouin mihing lungtang na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua chin amauten nang ahing giing ding ua, kapu le pate uh na piehna gam a aten sungsie uh na lampite azui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Na mi Israelte hilou gamdangmi hinapi a, na min thupitah leh na khut hattah leh na banzah zieh a, gamlapi a kipat a, hing pei a, tami biehinn lam nga a, ahing thum chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuabang hun chiengin, na umna van a kipat in ana ngaikhie inlen, tua gamdangmi in angetnate bawl piehin. Tua hileh namite mabangin, leitunga mi zousiein na min theiin, azau ding ua, tualeh tam ka inn lam na min puo ahi, chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Nang namite nasawlna lam lam a, amelmate uh dou dinga akuon chiengun, na telsa tam khopi leh na min dinga ka lam tami biehinn lam nga a, ahing thum chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Van akipat in athumna u’leh angette uh na ngaikhieh pieh inlen, guolzawlna pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Akhiellou lah koima um samlou a, amauh zong na tunga atawnkhel ua, atung ua na lungthah a, amelmate uh kunga na piehkhieh a, gamdang agamla leh anai a sal a apuimang chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Asaltanna gam ua, ahing kigeldoh thei ua, alungtangte uh henga, ahing kisia ua, asaltanna gam ua, kana khielta ua, dihlou tahin kana bawl uh a, giloutahin kana gamta khata uhi, chia na kunga ahing thum ngetngut chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sal a amaute kipuimangna gam a, alungtang zousie u’leh ahinna zousie ua, apu leh pate uh na pieh gamlam leh na telsa tami khopi lam leh na min ding a ka lam tami biehinn lam nga a ahing thum u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuabang hun chiengin, na umna van a kipat in athumna u’leh angetnate uh na ngaikhie inlen, bawl piehin, tualeh na tunga khiel na mite ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka Pasian aw, “Tuin hepitahin tam mun a ka thumnate, ah na mitte hah inlen, na bilte na daw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Pasian, Tuin thou inlen, na khawlna, mun ah hing peita in. Nangma leh na hatna bawm na siempute, Hundamna silsahin um uhen len; Na mi siengthoute, na hoina ah nuom uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian aw, Na sathau nupa nuolsin, Na suoh David kunga na chiemsa, Itna thupi thei ngitnget in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in thumna azaw tahin van akipat in meikuong ahing kesuh a, halmang sillat leh kithoinate akatum a, biehinn sungah Mangpa thupina in biehinn sung aluo dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuabanga Mangpa thupinain, biehinn sung aluodimtah zieh in, siempute Mangpa biehinn sung ah alut theita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite zousie in, meikuong hing kesuh leh inn tunga Mangpa thupina amu tahun, leituol ah amai ua leisu in abohkhup ua, Mangpa abie ua, tambangin kipah thu agen uhi: “Ama ahoi a, a khotuona khu kumtawn a um ding ahi zieh in” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa leh mipite zousie in Mangpa mai ah kithoinate alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lengpa Solomon in zong bawng tul sawmni leh tul ni leh belam leh kel tul zakhat leh tul sawmni kithoina in alan hi. Tuachi’n leengpa leh mipite zousie in, Pasian biehinn alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siemputen amun uh aluo chiet ua, Leviten zong Mangpa pahtawina tumging vanzahte tawi kawm in, amun uh aluo uhi. Tua tumgingte khu leengpa David in Mangpa phatna dinga ana bawl ahia, tuate zangin aman Mangpa kungah kipah thu ana gen a: A itna khu kumtawn in aum hi, ana chi hi. Tuachi’n Levite mai zawn ah siemputen pengkul amut ua, Israel mipite zousie ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuate ban ah Solomon in Mangpa biehinn mai leituol laita pen zong asusiengthou a, tuanah halmang sillatte leh lemna sillat sa thau alan hi, aziehpen ama bawlsa sum-eng maitam in halmang sillatte ann sillatte leh thau sillatte adawl zoulou zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuami tungin Solomon, akunga Israel mi zousie Hamath lutna akipat a Izipt luipi donga mipi kikhawmte atam a tamte toh ni sagi sung pawi abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni giet niin kikhopna siengthou anei uhi, nisagi sung maitam latna lopna anei ua, tualeh ni sagi sungma pawi abawl be nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ha sagina, ni sawmni leh nithum niin, mipite a inn lam chiet uah apei sahta a, Mangpa’n David kung leh Solomon kung leh ami Israelte kunga hoina alatsah ziehin nuom leh kipah tahin aum chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon in Mangpa biehinn leh leeng innpi alam zouta a, Solomon in alungsim a atup bang taha, Mangpa biehinn leh ama inn lamzang tah a apichin sah tah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa Solomon kungah zankhang lai in ahing kilah a, akungah; “Na thumnate ka za a, tualeh kithoinate latna biehinn hi ding in tam mun ka telta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vante ka kha binga, guo azuh sih a, ahisihleh gam suse dinga khauphete thu kapieh ahiei, ahisihleh ka mite lah a hipi ka lensah chieng ahiei in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka min a kilou, ka mite ki ngaingiem a, athum ua, ka maipha asui ua, a umdan giloute uh akiheisan u’leh, van a kipat in kana ngaikhe dinga, akhelna uh ka ngaidam dinga, agam uh kadamsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin ka mitte ka hah sah dinga, tam mun a athumnate uh bil ka daw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin kumtawna ka min umdenna dingin tami biehinn ka telta a, ka susiengthouta, hi; ka mit leh ka lungtang tuamun ah, hun chin in a umdenta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang na hileh, na pa David banga, ka masanga na pei a, ka thupiehte zousie na zui a, ka thu gousiete leh ka dan thute na nit leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israelte lah a vaihawm ding na tasam sih ding chia na pa David kunga thu kana hun dungzuiin na leenggam toupha ka sukip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hinanleh na kiheimang ua, ka thugousiete leh ka thupiehte, taisan a, pasien dangte nna sem ding leh amaute be dinga na kuon leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amauh ka piehsa ka gam a pat in Israel ka botdoh dinga, ka min dinga ka suhsiengthousa tami bieh inn zong ka dei nawn sih dinga, ka mu phahlou ah ka suonmang dinga, nam zousie lah ah paunah leh aselama mite houlim nopna in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tami biehinn tuin thupisahna toh ding viel vuol nanleh akunga pei kha pouma in dip hum zenin lamdang asa ding ua, Bang zieha Mangpa’n tam gam leh tami biehinn tunga tam banga abawl va-ia adiei? achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mite’n a dawng ding ua, Izipt gam a kipata amaute puidohpa, apu leh pate uh Mangpa Pasian, ataisan ua, pasien dangte abel ua, abie ua, tualeh a nna uh asep pieh zieh uh ahi, tuazieh a amaute tunga tambang sietna zousie atun sah ahi,” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in Mangpa biehinn leh ama innpi alamsung kum sawmni ahing bei bepin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiram in apiehsa khotate, Solomon in alam tha kia a, tuate ah Israel mite ateng sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Hamath-Zobah ava dou a, alata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman gamdai ah Tadmor alam a, tualeh Hamath a van koikhawmna khopi alamsate zong alam toupeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beth-Horon sahta leh Beth Horon hangta zong kulpinei khopite in abawl a, kulpi baangte leh akotpite leh akalna zawlte zong abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ban-ah Baalath leh van koikhawmna khopite, sakollengte zousie leh sakolte koina ding khopite leh Jerusalem leh Lebanon tualeh avaihawmna gam sunga abawl guot zousie abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Israel mite hilou, Hitmite, Amormite, Perizmite, Hivmite, lah a kipat kinuasiete zousie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hahlesuonte Israel gam sungah aum ua, tuate Israelten asumangthai sih uhi. Solomon in tuabang mite khu suoh nasem dingin akoi a, tuni tan in tuabangin aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Solomon in Israel tate koima suohnasem in apangsah sih a, galkap lamkaite lah a lienpente, sakollengte leh sakolleng hawlte lamkaite in apang sah zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamte khu Solomon leengpa lamkaite leh ulienpente in apang ua, mite nasep enkoltu, zani leh sawm nga apha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon in Pharaoh tanu David khopi apat in, amanu dinga a inn bawl pieh ah apuitou a, aziehpen, “Kazi Israel leengpa inn ah aum thei sih ding hi, Pasian bawm hing lutna ahi, ziehin amun asiengthou hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in biehinn mailam a abawl, Mangpa maitam tungah Mangpa adingin halmang sillatte alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi thupieh dungzui a, ni chin a dinga bituh mabangin, khawlnite, ha tha nite, leh kum sim akibawl pawi thumte: Tanghou tolsawlou pawi, Nipikaal pawi leh Biehbuh pawite; adingin alan zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Apa David thupieh dungzui in, apawl pawl a kikhen siempute sep ding aguon a, Levite phatna lamkai ding leh nichin a akulna banga siempute hu dingin aguot hi. Aman kotkha vengmite zong kotkha tuom tuom a apawl pawl a pang dingin aguot hi, aziehpen tambangin Pasian mi David in thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lengpa’n siempute ahisihleh Levite thu apieh pouma bang thu hitaleh, sum koikhawmna thu toh kisai nangawn zong suilou in apielsan sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa biehinn suongphum akiphum ni apat inn lam akizaw dongin, alung tup bangin asemtou zel a, tuachi’n Mangpa biehinn lam zou ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Edom gam a tuipi gei a, Ezion Geber leh Elath ah ava haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Hiram in tuipi a gamta siem mama ama uliente lamkaina in tembawte asawl hi. Tam mite Solomon mite toh zoh khawm in Ophir ah avahaw ua, khuna pat in sana talent zali leh sawm nga ahing puo ua, leengpa Solomon kungah ahing tut uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sheba leengnu in Solomon minthandan azah tah in dohna hasa pipi toh Solomon etchien tum in, nuazui atama tampi toh gimnamtui pua sangawngsaute toh sana atam atam leh suongmantamte hing puo in Jerusalem ah ahing haw a, tualeh Solomon kung ahing tun tahin alungsim a um zousie pholkhe siengin ama ahoupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in adohna zousie a dawnga, ahilchien theilou mawngmawng bangma aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sheba leengnu’n Solomon pilna leh a inn bawldan amu bepin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />adawkan a a annnehte, amiliente toudante, anasemte nasepdante leh apuon tuol silte uh uoin pemite leh apuon tuol silte uh tualeh Mangpa biehinn a halmang sillatte amu tahin lamdang sahna in adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amanu’n leengpa kungah, “Na silbawlte leh na pilna thu kigente ka gam a ka zahte adih ana hi ngut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh hing pei a, ka mit mama a ka hing mu masangsie’n kana tahsang sih hi; atahtahin na pilna thupi dan akim alang zong hing na kihillou ahi. Na minthanna thu kigensawn kana zahte na khup khel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mite nah hamphat hina uh e, na masang a ding ngitnget a, na pilna thu ngaikhie na uliente hampha hina mai uh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian a dinga, vaihawm dinga a leengtoupha a, nang hing tousah dinga na tunga kipah Mangpa na Pasian pahtawi in umta hen; Na Pasian in Israelte a it zieh leh amaute kumtawn a tunding den a ut man a, thudih leh dihtatna kem dinga, amaute tunga nang leengpa a ahing bawl ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman sana talent za leh sawmni leh gimnamtui tampi tualeh suongmantamte toh leengpa apie hi. Sheba leengnu’n, leengpa Solomon apieh bang gimnamtui mawngmawng a um ngai nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiram mite leh Solomon miten Ophir akipat sana ahing puo ua, algum sing leh suongmantamte zong ahing puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leengpa’n tua algum singte, Mangpa biehinn kellei leh leeng innpi kelleite bawlna ding leh tumging tumte adinga pehgingte leh kaigingte bawlna dingin azang hi. Juda gam ah tambang mawngmawng akimukha ngai nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lengpa Solomon in Sheba leengnu kungah alunggul pouma leh anget pouma apie hi. Tuachi’n leengnu akipandoh a, ahing zawpi anuazuiteng toh agam lam ah akinuale kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon in kum chin a amu sana gihdan talent za guh sawmguh leh guh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuate lah ah summet bawlte leh vanzuate’n sie apiehte uh kisimtel nailou ahinalai hi. Arabia gam leengte leh agam uhpipaten zong sana leh dangka Solomon ahing puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lengpa Solomon in sana khenthawin lum lien zani abawl a, lum khat bawlna in sana shekel zaguh chiet alut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaban ah sana khenthaw in lum neu zathum abawla, lum khat bawlna in sana shekel zathum chiet alut hi. Lengpa’n tuate Lebanon gammang innpi ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuathamlouin leengpa’n saiha leengtoupha thupitah abawl a sana sieng tui in aluonkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua leengtoupha kalna kellei guh a um a, leengtoupha toh kizop sana kengngapna abawl hi. Tua toupha siih tuoh ah, khutngapna toupha bante leh akunga humpibahnei ding lim ni a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua leengtoupha kellei guhte mong chietah humpibahnei sawm leh ni ading a; leenggam dangten tuabang mawngmawng abawl ngai nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lengpa Solomon noute zousie sana akibawl ahia, tualeh Lebanon gammang innpi sunga um vanzahte zousie sana sieng set a kibawl ngen ahi. Solomon hun lai in dangkasia pen manphalou zaw a, ngai ahi ziehin dangkasia in bangma akibawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lengpa’n sum met bawlna tembawpi Tarshish gam donga pei thei tampi anei a, tuate Hiram miten ahawl uhi. Kum thum hal in tua Tarshish tembawte, sana, dangka sia leh saiha, tualeh zawng liente leh utongte puo in ahing kinua le zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lengpa Solomon pen leitunga leeng dang teng sangin hauna leh pilna ah atungnung zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in Solomon lungtanga akoi pilna thute ngaikhe nuom in, leitung leengte zousie in Solomon kung ahing zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kum chin a ama kunga hing pei zousieten, silpieh: sana leh dangka a kibawl vante leengpuontuolte, galvante, gimnamtuite, sakolte leh sabiltungte ahing puoh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon in sakolte leh sakollengte koina dingin buh tul li anei a; sakollengte koina khopite a akoite leh ama kunga Jerusalem a akoi sakol tul sawm leh tul ni zong anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Euphrates luipi apat Philistinte gam dong leh Izipt gamgi chieng donga leengte zousie tungah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Jerusalem ah dangka siate khu atam seng ziehin suongtum bang mai in tualeh sidar singte zong muol zung phaijangte a theipi sing bang giapin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomon sakolte khu Izipt gam leh gam dang danga kipat a lah lut ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Solomon vaihawm sunga siltung dang dangte abul apat atawp dongin, guolnei Nathan sil chiemtena laibu leh Shilonmi Ahijah genlawhna leh Nebat tapa Jeroboam toh kisai a, mailam thumavang genpa guolnei Iddo mengmuna laibu ah akigiel hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomon in Jerusalem ah Israelte zousie tungah kum sawm li vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon apu leh pate kungah a i muta a, apa David khopi ah akivuita hi. Atapa Rehoboam ama thahengin leengpa in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam leengpa a bawl dinga Israelte zousie Shekem a apeitah ziehun ama zong Shekem ah ava hawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nebat tapa Jeroboam leengpa Solomon akipata taimang Izipt gam a um in, tuathu azah tahin Izipt akipat in Jeroboam ahing kinuale kia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeroboam ahansah ua, ama leh Israel mi zousie Rehoboam kungah ava haw ua, akungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na pan koute hahkol gihtah angna guon a, hinanleh tuin nang nasep hasa leh hahkol gihtah na pa’n ana hing guon khu jangsah inlen, tuachi’n na nna sem in ka hing zui ding uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rehoboam in adawnga, “Nithum zou chiengin hing pei kia un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n mipite apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Rehoboam in apa Solomon dam lai a, anna nasem, upate thu akikuppi a, “Tam mipite dawn ding dan, bang ngaidan nang pe thei uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amauten adawng ua, “Tam mite na hepi siem a amaute na lungkim sah a, dawnna hoitah na pieh leh na suohte ahiden ding uh, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Rehoboam in upate thuhilna a sangta sih a, ama khanguol a nna sem tangvalte thu akikuppi zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama’n amaute kungah, ka kunga, “Na pan koute hahkol gihtah ahingna guon hing suh jangkhai piehin chia hing gen mipite bang chi dawn ding ihi uoi? Nouten bang thu ahiei nang mop thei uh?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama khanguol tangvalten adawng ua; “Na kunga Na pan hahkol gihtah koute ahing guon a, hinanleh tuin ka hahkol uh hing suh jang piehin chia hing gen mipite kungah, ka khutme ka pa kawng sangin alien zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pa’n hahkol gihtah noute ahing guon a, Ken agih zaw sem kang guon dinga, ka pa’n zepna khauhuol in noute ang zepa, ken khauhuol lingneite in kang zep ding hi,” chi in, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lengpa’n ni thum nua chiengin ka kungah “Hing hawkia un achi dungzui in, Jeroboam leh mipite zousie, ni thum zouin Rehoboam kungah ahing haw kia uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lengpa’n upate thu hilna sangtalouin, amaute khautah in ana dawngta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tangvalte thuhilna zui in amaute kungah, “Ka pa’n na hahkol uh ana gihsah a, ken kang gihsah sem nalai ding hi. Ka pa’n khauhuolin ang zep a, ken khauhuol lingneite in kang zep ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n mipite thu angaikhiet piehta sih hi; Aziehpen Mangpa’n Shilon mi Ahijah zanga, Nebat tapa Jeroboam kunga ana gensa athu tangtunna ding a, Pasian a hing kipan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israelmi zousiein leengpa’n athu uh angaikhiet pieh nuom sih chi a theitah un, leengpa adawng ua, “David ah bang tanvou ahiei ka nei uh? Jesse tapa ah goutan bangma ka nei sih uhi. Israel aw na puon inn chiet uah peita un, Aw David na inn sung kingaituo mai in” achi uhi. Tuachi’n Israelmite zousie a inn lamchiet uh zuon in apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Juda khopite a teng Israelte tungah Rehoboam in vai ahawmkhum nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leengpa Rehoboam in nasem a pauhat a kiguoite tunga lamkaipa Adoniram asawl a, tuachi’n Israel mipiten suongin ana seplumta uhi. Bangteng hileh leengpa Rehoboam a sakolleng ah atuong thei hamham a, Jerusalem tandong asuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte tuni dongin David innkuonte tung ah ahel denta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam Jerusalem a ahing tun tah in, Israel dou ding leh Rehoboam a dinga leenggam nualah kia dingin Juda leh Benjamin innkuonte akipat galkap mi tul za leh tul sawm giet akhawm khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh tam Mangpa thu Pasian mipa Shemaiah kungah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Juda leengpa Solomon tapa Rehoboam kungah leh Juda leh Benjamin gam a Israelmi um zousiete kungah tam thu va gen in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa’n agen hi, na sanggamte uh dou dingin kuontou sih un, na bawn un na inn lam chiet uah peita un, tam sil keima bawl ahi chi in,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amaun Mangpa thu amang ua, Jeroboam dou dinga kuon nawnlou in anua kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rehoboam Jerusalem ah atenga, Juda gam venbitna dingin khopite abawl hi. Tuate khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem, Elam leh Tekoa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Beth-zur, Sokoh leh Adullam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gath, Mareshah leh Ziph,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adoraim, Lakish leh Azekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zorah, Aijalon leh Hebron, ahi. Tamte khu Juda leh Benjamin gam a kulpi nei khopite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman kulpite akhokhum a, asungah lamkai dingte akoi a, nehletah, Olive thau leh uointe akoikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua khopite zousie ah lum leh teipite akoi a, tua khopite zousie muonhuoi tahin abawla, Tuate khu khopi muonhuoi tahin abawla, tuachi’n Juda leh Benjamin ama a ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel gam pumpi a siempute leh Leviten atenna gamkai chiet ua kipat in Rehoboam lam ah apang chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leviten a louhing gamte u’leh anei alamte uh nua sie in Juda gam leh Jerusalem ah ahing pei uhi. Aziehpen Jeroboam leh atapaten, Mangpa dinga a siempu nasepna ua pat amaute atawpsah zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeroboam in mun sangte a ding leh kel leh bawngnou lim abawlte a dingin leh ama Siempu ding atuom in aguot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel nam tuom tuomte lah a mi, Mangpa Israel Pasian sui nuomte zousie in, Mangpa apu apate uh Pasian kunga kithoina lan dingin Levite Jerusalem ah azui suh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaun kum thum sung Juda leenggam asuhat ua, Solomon tapa Rehoboam a panpi uhi. Aziehpen amaun khum hun sung David leh Solomon lampite azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rehoboam in David tapa Jerimoth tanu Mahalath zi in anei a, Jesse tapa Eliab tanu Abihail zong zi in anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mahalath in tapate ahinga: Jeush, Shemariah leh Zaham ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zou in Absalom tanu Maakah akitenpi a, amanu’n, Abijah, Attai, Zizah leh Shelomith ahinpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehoboam in azipite leh ameite zousie sangin Absalom tanu Maakah a it pen hi. Aman zipi sawm leh giet anei a, tualeh mei sawm guh anei hi. Tapa sawmni leh giet leh tanu sawm guh anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rehoboam in Maakah tapa Abijah leengpa a bawl ding alung gul ziehin asanggamte lah ah lamkai pen in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pilvang tahin abawl a, atapate zousie Juda gam leh Benjamin gam a khopi kulpi neite ah a umsah chiet a, tualeh neh leh taah ding kiching tah in amaute apie a, tualeh zi tampi aguon chiet hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam leengpa hina din mun dettah ahi nua-in leh ama ahing hattah in, Ama leh Israelte zousie in Mangpa danthupiehte ataisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa tunga amuonhuoilou ziehun, Rehoboam vaihawm akum ngana kum in, Izipt leengpa Shishak in Jerusalem adou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sakolleng tul khat leh zani leh sakol tungtuongmi tul sawm guh toh, Izipt akipat a hing zui Libia mite leh Sukmite tualeh Ethiopia mite galkap simsengloute toh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda gam a khopi kulpi nei tampi ala a, Jerusalem dong ahing tungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Shemaiah Rehoboam kung leh Shishak zau zieh a Jerusalem a hing peikhawm lamkaite kungah ahing haw a, amaute kungah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; “Nouten kei na hing taisanta ua, tuazieh a ken zong tua Shishak khuta noute hing taisan ka hita, achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel lamkaite leh leengpa akingiemkhieh ua, “Mangpa khu adihtat ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa’n amaute akingaingiemta uh chi amu tahin, Mangpa thu Shemaiah kungah ahing tunga, “Aman, amaute akingaingiem tah ziehun ka sumang sih dinga, hinanleh hutkhiehna ka pe pai zaw ding hi. Ka thangpaina zong Shishak zangin Jerusalem tungah ka sungbaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh asuohte in apang ding uhi, tuachi’n kei nna asep u’leh gamdang leengte nna asep uh kibahlou dan athei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izipt leengpa Shishak in Jerusalem adou tah in, Mangpa biehinn leh leengpa inn a gou kikoikhawmte apomanga, Solomon in ana bawl sana lumte zong apomang siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Rehoboam in tuate taangin sum-eng lumte abawl a, leengpa innpi lutna kotpi vengmi lamkaite azangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lengpa Mangpa bieh inn a ahaw chiengin, vengmiten tua lumte tawi in azui ua, tuazou chiengin vengmite umna inndan sungah akoi kia zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rehoboam akingngaingiem ziehin Mangpa lungthahna ama akipat in heimang in a um a, suhmang kilkel in aum sih hi, tuachi’n Juda gam ah sil apei hoitou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lengpa Rehoboam khu Jerusalem ah akisukip a leeng ahi zomtou zel hi. Rehoboam leeng a apan chiil lai in kum sawmli leh khat a upa ahia, Mangpa’n amin umna dinga Israel nam zousiete lah a kipat a atel tuom khopi Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh sagi vai ahawm hi. Tualeh anu Ammon mi ahia, amin Naamah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rehoboam in Mangpa sui dinga lungtang asiemphatlou ziehin, sil gilou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rehoboam vaihawm sunga siltung zousiete abul apat atawp dong, guolnei Shemaiah laibu leh guolnei Iddo khangthu gelna laibu ah akigiel hilou ahiei mah? Tualeh Rehoboam leh Jereboam kikal ah kidouna aum tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rehoboam apu apate kungah a imuta a, David khopi ah akivui hi; tualeh ama thahengin atapa Abijah leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeroboam vaihawm kum sawm le gietna kum in Abijah Judate tungah leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem ah kum thum sung vai ahawm a, anu min Maakah ahia, Gibeah mi Uriel tanu ahi. Abijah leh Jeroboam kikaal ah kidouna a um leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abijah galkap kidou dan siem leh hangsan ngen tul zali toh kidouna phuol ah akuonta hi, tualeh Jeroboam in zong galkap kidou siem mi leh hangsan ngen tul za giet toh ama dou dingin pan mun akhaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abijah khu Ephraim singtang gam a Zemaraim muol tungah adinga, “Jeroboam leh Israelte zousie aw, hing na ngai khie un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa Israelte Pasian in, Israelte tunga leengpa hina David leh ahah asuonte kungah chi a thuhun in kumtawn ding in apieh ahi chi theilou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Nebat tapa Jeroboam David tapa Solomon nasemte lamkaipa, apu tungah ahelta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi lungsim sie, namanlou pawlkhat ama nua zui in akikhawm ua, Solomon tapa Rehoboam kal in apang uhi. Khum hun lai in Rehoboam anaupang nalai a, thukhentat dan asiem nai sih a, tualeh amaute nang dingin ahatzou nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuin nouten David hahle suonte khuta um Mangpa leenggam dal na tum uhi; Galkap tampi zong na hi ngut uh a, tualeh Jeroboam in noute pasiente hi dinga ang bawl pieh sana bawngnou limte zong na kung uah aum nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa siempute, Aaron tapate leh Levite delmangin gamdangte bawl dan a, nouma siempu a kibawl tawm hilou nahi uoi mah? Mi khat poupou hing pei a bawngtal guol khat leh belamtal sagi ahiei toh akisiensuo pouleh Pasian tah hilou bawlthu pasien te siempu a pang mai hilou uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh koute adingin Mangpa khu ka Pasian uh ahi a, Ama ka taisan ngai sih uhi. Mangpa nasem a pang siempute khu Aaron hahlesuonte ahi ua, Leviten amaute apanpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zingmawng leh nitah lam tengin amauten Mangpa mai ah halmang sillalte leh gimnamtuite alan ngitnget uhi; dawkan siengthou tungah, tanghou siengthou aguol guol in akoi zel uhi; nitah lam tengin sana thaumei tunna a thaumeite ade kuong zel uhi. Mangpa ka Pasian uh thupieh ka nit zing uhi, hinanleh nouten ama na taisanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai un, Pasian in koute ahing umpi a, Ama ka lamkaipa uh ahi hi. Ama siempute zong noute dou a, kidouna pengkul mut ding ahi uhi. Israel mite aw, Mangpa na pu leh pate uh Pasian dou sih un, na lawching tuom sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Jeroboam in anua lam uah guhtan dingin mi akuolin akoi dapa, ama uh Judate mai lam ah a um ua, aguh a buh pawl anua lam uah a pang sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judate kinuahei a a et u’leh, anua lam u’leh amai lam uah ahing douta uh chi amu uhi. Tuachi’n amaun Mangpa ahanta ua, siemputen pengkul amut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judate galdouna kikou in ahing kikou zoi zoi tah un, Pasian in Jeroboam leh Israelte zousie, Abijah leh Judate mai ah aguollel sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mite khu Judate masangah ataijahta ua, Pasian in Judate khut sungah Israelte apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abijah leh amiten amaute tungah manthaina nasatah atun ua, Israel galhat-hangsan ngen tul zanga ashi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuami tungin Israelte zawin aumta ua, Judate pen Mangpa apu leh pate uh Pasian tunga kinga ahi man un suhatin aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abijah in Jeroboam anuadel a, ama a kipat in akhopite, Bethel leh akho neute, Jeshanah leh akho neute tualeh Ephron leh akhoneute alahpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeroboam in Abijah dam sungin thahatna anei zou nawn sih hi. Mangpa’n atungah khut aha a ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Abijah pen ahat deudeu a, zi sawm leh li anei a, tapa sawmni leh ni leh tanu sawm leh guh anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abijah vaihawm sunga siltung dangte asil bawlte leh athugente guolnei Iddo laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abijah apu leh pate kungah a imuta a, tualeh David khopi ah avuita uhi. Ama thahengin atapa Asa leeng in apangta hi. Ama vaihawm sungin gam sung pumpi kum sawm sung galmuongin aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa in Mangpa a Pasian mitmu in sil hoi leh adih abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamdang pasien maitamte leh mun sangte asubei a, suong milimte a satguoi a, Ashera songlaite aphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Apu apate uh Mangpa Pasian sui ding leh adanthute leh athupiehte zui dingin Judate thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda gam khopite zousie akipat in mun sangte leh gimnamtui halna maitamte alamang sienga, ama nuoi ah aleenggam galmuongin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gam in galmuonna nei ahitah manin Juda gam a kulpinei khopi abawl a, Mangpa’n ama galmuong a aum sah ziehin, tua hunlaiin koima toh akidou sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman Juda mite kungah, “Tam khopite ilam ding ua, akimkot ah kulbangte in i imkhum ding ua, innsangte, kotpite leh akalnate ibawl ding uhi. Mangpa i Pasian isui ua, Ama isui zieh un aman zong mun chinteng ah tawldamna ahing peta hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n alamta ua, alawching zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa in Juda nam apat galkap lum leh teipi tawi thei tul za thum anei a, Benjamin nam akipat in lum tawi leh thal kapmi tul zani leh tul sawmgiet anei hi; abawn un mihat leh galhangsan ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia mi Zerah galkap maktaduoi khat leh sakolleng za thum toh amaute dou dingin ahing kuon a, Mareshah tandong ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asa zong amau’toh kidou dingin akuonkhie a, Mareshah kunga Zephathah phaijangah panmun a khaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asa in Mangpa a Pasian ahan a, akung ah, “Mangpa aw ahatte dou dinga hatna neiloute panpi dingin nang loungal koima a um sih hi. Mangpa koute Pasian aw, Hing panpi in, nangma tunga kinga leh na min suonga, galkap hizapi dou dinga hing kuon kahi bou uhi. Mangpa koute Pasian na hi. Mihingin kizousah vawt sin,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Asa leh Judate masangah, Ethiopia mite tungah akhut aha a, Ethiopia mite ataijahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asa leh agalkapten Gerar dong anuadel ua, Ethiopiamite aguollel seng tah ziehun apang thei nawn sih uhi. Mangpa leh agalkapte mai ah totchilin aum ua, Judaten galvanlah tampi apokhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Gerar kimvel a khoneute zousie asumang sieng uhi, aziehpen Mangpa zauna chizatna in amaute amanta hi. Tua khoneute ah galvan lah atam seng seng a, tuate akipuohmang siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ganchingte giehphuolte zong abulu ua, belamhon, kel hon leh sangawngsaute akaimang uhi. Tuachi’n Jerusalem ah akinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Obed tapa Azariah tungah Pasian hagau ahing tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Azariah Asa kimupi dingin akuon khie a, akungah, “Asa leh Juda leh Benjaminte zousie in, ka thu na ngaikhie un. Mangpa lam a na pan u’leh ama zong noute lam ah apang dinga, Ama na sui u’leh na mu ding uhi, hinanleh ama na taisan u’leh aman zong noute ahing taisan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen hun sawtpi sung Israelte Pasian dihtah neilou, hil ding mi siempu neilou leh dan neilou in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh amangbat hun chieng ua, Mangpa Israelte Pasian lam a akihei ua, Ama asui chiengun, amaute mu in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua gam a tengte zousie apum buoi gawp zieh un, khum hun lai in, apawtdoh ding leh ahing lut dingin hamuonna aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian in amaute mangbatna chintenga asuh buoi ziehin, Nam khat in nam dang, tualeh khopi khat in khopi dang, simmaw in asusie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh noute pen kisuhat unlen, na nasep uh tawpsan sih un, azieh pen na sepman uh mu ding na hi uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa in tam thute leh Obed tapa guolnei Azariah thugenlawhte azah tahin akisuhangsan a, Juda leh Benjamin gamsung pumpi apat leh Ephraim singtang gam a khopi neute akipat in milim kidahhuoite a paimanga, tualeh Mangpa biehinn him mai a, Mangpa maitam asiemtha kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Judami leh Benjamin mite leh alah ua teng Ephraim, Manasseh leh Simeon namte ahankhawm hi. Amauten Mangpa a Pasian in Asa a umpi chi amutahun, Israel gam akipat in mi tampi in ama kung ahing zuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute Asa vaihawm kum, akum sawm leh ngana, aha thumna ah, Jerusalem ah ahing peikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khumi tungin gallah sil a ahing puoh uh bawng za sagi leh belam leh kel tul sawm sagi Mangpa mai ah alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amauten alungtang zousie u’leh ahinna zousie u’toh Mangpa apu apate uh Pasian sui dingin, thuhun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa Israelte Pasian sui nuomlou pouma alien hiin aneu hitaleh, Numei hiin pasal hitaleh tha ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thanuom tah a kikouna aw ging ngaitah toh, pengkul leh belamtal kii te mut ging toh Mangpa tungah kichiemna abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Alungtang zousie ua kichiem ahi zieh un, Judate zousie akichiemna thu uah lungnuom in akipah uhi. Kilawptahin Pasian asui ua, tuachi’n Ama, amaute muin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lengpa Asa in api Maakah zong, akidahhuoi Ashera songlai aphu ziehin Lengpanu ahina dinmun akipat aza kesah hi. Asa in tua asonglai phu aphua a, asatnen gawpa, kidron luipang ah ahal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman Israel gamsunga kipat in mun sangte phietmang sieng sih nanleh, Asa in adamsung tengin Mangpa kungah alungtang zousie apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama leh apa’n ana latsa uh sana, dangka sildangte, aman Mangpa biehinn sungah apolut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asa vaihawm kum, akum sawm thum leh ngana tandongin kidouna aum nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asa vaihawm kum sawmthum leh guhna kum in Israel leengpa Baasha Juda gam dou ding in ahing kuontou a, Juda leengpa Asa gam sunga koima lut leh pawt ding dalna in Ramah ah kulpi abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asa in Mangpa biehinn a gou koina leh ama leeng innpi a gou koina akipat in sana leh dangka aladoh a, Damaska a vaihawmpa Siria leengpa Benhadad kungah ahah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aman Benhadad kungah: ka pa leh napa kikaal a lemna thuhun ana um bangin, kei leh nang kikaal ah zong lemna thuhum um hen. En in sana leh dangka kang hah hi. Israel leengpa Baasha in kei ang kihepmangsan theina dingin, amatoh kikaal a lemna thuhun na nei uh phel mai ve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Benhadad in leengpa Asa thugen pha asah pia, Israel khopite dou dingin agalkap lamkaite asawlta hi. Amauten Ijion, Dan, Abel-Maim leh Naphtali gam a van koina khopite ava zou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baasha in tam thu azah tahin Ramah alam atawpsan a, anasep akhawlsanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Asa in Juda gam a mi zousie azawpi a, Baasha in Ramah khopi abawlna a azah sing leh suongte abawn in ava pomang ua, tuate zang in Geba leh Mizpah alam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum hunlai in guolnei Hanani Juda leengpa Asa kungah ahing pei a, akungah; “Mangpa na Pasian tunga kingalou a, Siria leengpa tunga na kingah zawh ziehin, Siria leengpa galkapte na khut sunga kipat in asuohta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethiopia leh Libiate galkap hon thupitah, sakolleng leh sakol tungtuongmi tampi neite ahi sih uh amah? hinanleh Mangpa na muon ziah in na khut ah ahing pe khie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa mit khu ama tunga lungtang dihtah paw mite hatsah dingin leitung pumpi ah avah kawikawi hi. Mot huoi tahin sil nana bawlta a, tuaziehin tulang kalsie gal na nei zingta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin Asa guolneipa tungah alungthahta a, alungthah seng ziehin guolneipa suongkul ah a khumta hi. Tua hunlai mama in Asa in mi pawl khatte nuoisie tahin abawlse nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa vaihawm sung sil tungte abul apat atawp dong, Juda leh Israel leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama vaihawm kum sawmthum leh kum kuona ah Asa kengah natna khat ahing umta a, a natna pen ahing nase deudeuta hi, hinanleh aman anatna ziehin Mangpa asui tuom sih a, damdawi siemte a dong zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asa apulepate kungah a imuta a, kum sawm li leh kum khat avaihawm kum in ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David khopi a ama mama in abawl han ah avuita uhi, tualeh gimnamtui bawlmite gimnamtui leh lounamtui chituom tuom a dim lupna tungah asiel ua, ama zana in meikuong thupitah abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama thahengin atapa Jehoshaphat leengpa in apang a, Israelte dou dingin ahing kisuhatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman Juda gam a khopi kulpinei zousie ah galkapte akoi a, Juda gam leh apa Asa in Ephraim gamsung a, khopi ana lahte ah zong galkapte akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in achiil lai a apu David totna lampi azui ziehin leh Baalte thu adohlou ziehin, Mangpa’n ama a umpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh apa Pasian asui a, Israelte gamtat banga gamta lou in, Pasian thupiehte azui zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n akhut ah lenggam asuhkip a; Judate zousie in Jehoshaphat kungah silpiehte ahing tawi uhi; tuachi’n hausatna leh pahtawina kiningchingtah angata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Alungtang zousie toh kipezou tahin Mangpa lampi azui hi. Tuate gentahlouin, Juda gam akipat in mun sangte leh Ashera songlaite aphietmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Avaihawm kum thumna ah, Juda khopite a zilsah dingin ami liente, Ben-Hail, Obadiah, Zekariah, Nethaneel, leh Mikaiah asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amautoh Levimite, Shemaiah, Nathaniah, Asahel, Shemiramoth, Jehonathan, Adonijah, Tobijah leh Tob-Adonijah leh siempute Elishama, leh Jehoram te zong asawl khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amauten Mangpa dan laibu akeng ua, Juda gamsung zousie ah azil sah ua, Juda khopite zousie ah ava haw kawi kawi ua, mipite ava zilsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda gam kimvel a leenggam zousie tungah Mangpa giinna ahing tunga, Jehoshaphat toh akidou nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistinte pawlkhat in sie dan in silpiehte leh dangka siate Jehoshaphat ahing puoh uhi. Tualeh Arabten zong ama a dingin belam leh kel hon ahing puoh uhi; tuate belamtal tul sagi leh za sagi tualeh kel tul sagi leh za sagi, apha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehoshaphat ahing thahat semsem a, Juda gamsungah kulpite leh van koikhawmna khopite abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Juda khopite ah neh leh taah tampi anei a, tualeh aman Jerusalem ah galdou siemsa mite zong akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute aphung aphunga kisimna lai bu a min kikhumdan tambang ahi: Juda nam akipat tul tunga lamkaite; lamkai lienpen Adna amakaina nuoi ah galkap tul za thum aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh azomin galkap lamkai Jehohanan ahia ama nuoi ah galkap tul zani leh tul sawm giet a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh ama zom in Mangpa nasem dinga ama ut-thu a kipie Zikri tapa Amasiah ahi a ama nuoi ah galkap tul zani a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin nam akipat in galkap hangsan Eliada ahi a, thal leh lumte a kigalvon tul zani aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama zomin Zehozabad ahia, ama nuoi ah galdou dinga kimansa galkap tul za leh tul sawm giet aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tamte in, Juda gamsung pumpi a kulpinei khopite a leengpa’n akoite simlou in leengpa vengin aum ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Jehoshaphat in hausatna leh zatatna thupitah ahing neita a, zi leh ta a kineina tungtawnin Ahab toh kizopna ahing bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kum bangza ahiei nua in, Samaria ah Ahab ve dingin ahaw suh a, Ahab leengpa’n Jehoshaphat leh azawpi mipite belam leh bawng tampi ana gaw a, tualeh Ramoth Gilead dou dingin ana dawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel leengpa Ahab in, Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat kungah, “Ramoth Gilead dou dingin nang kuontoupi diei?” chiin adong hi. Jehoshaphat in adawnga, “Kei leh nang tualeh ka mite leh na mite pum khat ihi uhi; galdouna kang doupi ding uh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Jehoshaphat in Israel leengpa kungah, “Mangpa thu dong masa phot in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n guolneite za li ahan khawm a, akung uah; “Ramoth Gilead dou dingin ka kuon ding uoi? ahisihleh ka khawlsan zaw ding uoi?” chi’n adongta hi. Amauten adawng ua, “Kuon in Pasian in leengpa khut ah tua gam hingpe ding ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Jehoshaphat in, “Tanah Mangpa guolnei idoh thei ding a um sih amah?” chiin adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel leengpa’n Jehoshaphat adawnga, akungah, “Mangpa hing doh pieh thei ding guolnei khat um nalai mah e, hinanleh ama ka huo hi, aziehpen aman ka tungtang thu ahoilam mawngmawngin agen ngai sih a, aselam ngen in agen hi; ama khu Imla tapa Mikaiah ahi,” achi hi. Tualeh Jehoshaphat in,” Lengpa’n tuabang na chi ding hilou ahi,” chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n ami liente khat ahan a, akungah, ‘Kintahin Imla tapa Makaiah hing zawpi in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel leengpa leh Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat khu aleeng puontuol tuoh uh sil in, Samaria kotpi lutna kunga buphuol ah, aleengtoupha tuoh uoh atou uhi, Amaute gel mai ah guolnei zousie zong thumavang gen in aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kenaanah tapa Zedekiah in sia in kiite abawl a tami Mangpa thu agen ahi, “Aman Siriate suhmangthai a aum masang sie uh tamte toh amaute na sun ziel ziel ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Guolnei dangte zousie in zong akibang in thumavang agen chiet ua, “Ramoth Gilead va dou inlen, va guolzou in. Mangpa’n leengpa khut ah tua gam ahing pe ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mikaiah han dinga va kuon pa’n akungah, “Ngai vawi, guolnei dang tengin mi khat bang mai in leengpa lawchinna dingin ahoilam ngen in thumavang agen chiet uhi; tuaziehin nang zong amaute lah a khat bangin ahoilam in thu gen maiin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Mikaiah in akungah, “Mangpa min sielin ka gen ahi, ka Pasian gen teng kagen ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama ahing tun tah in, leengpa’n ama adong a, “Mikaiah Ramoth Gilead dou dingin ka kuon ding uoi? ahisihleh ka khawlsan zaw ding uoi? achi hi. Aman adawnga, va kuontou unlen, va guolzou un, amaute na khut ah pieh ahi ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lengpa’n akungah, “Mangpa min a thutah loungal bangma dang ka kunga hing hillou dingin bangza vei hing kichiem sah ding ka hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mikaiah in adawnga, “Israelte zousie aching ding umlou belamte banga, muol tunga kithethangin ka mu hi; Mangpa’n tam miten lamkai anei sih uh, tuaziehin michin lungmuong tahin a inn lam chiet uah pei chiet ta uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel leengpa’n Jehoshaphat kungah; “Aman kei tungtang thu ah ahoilam agenlawh ngai sih a, aselam ngen a genlawh ngitnget hi, chi’n kang hil sih amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mikaiah in “Thu agenbe nalai a, Mangpa thu ngaikhie un, Mangpa aleengtoupha tunga tou a, aziet leh avei a van mipi zousie ding ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa’n Ramoth-Gilead dou ding leh khuna va shi dingin Israel leengpa Ahab koiin ahiei va zawl ding? achi hi. Khat in tambangin agen a, adang khat in, tua bangin agen hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Atawpin hagau khat ahing pawtdoh a, Mangpa mai ah adinga, Ken ama ka zawl ding, achi hi. Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Bang zangin e, chiin adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman kava kuon dinga aguolneite zousie kam ah hagau zuouthei kava hi ding, achi hi. Mangpa’n ama na zawl zou ding hi. Va kuon inlen tuabangin va bawl in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, Mangpa’n tam na guolneite kam ah hagau zuouthei akoita hi, Mangpa’n nang a dingin sietna a guotsa ahita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kenaanah tapa Zedekiah in azuontou a Mikaiah maitang abeenga, “Mangpa akipat tua hagau nang hing houpi dinga kei akipat apawtdoh laiin heilang ah apei ei?” chiin adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mikaiah in adawnga, “Inndan sungnung a kibu dinga na lut ni in thei na ve chin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n thu apie a; “Makaiah man unlen khopi uhpa Amon leh leengpa tapa Joash kungah nua zawpi kia unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lengpa’n tambangin agen hi; tam mipa suongkul ah khum unlen, damtah a ka hing kinuale kia masang sie’n, tanghou leh tui loungal bangma pe sih un, achi hi,” chi un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mikaiah in “Damtah a nang kinuale kia pouma leh Mangpa’n keima zanga thu genlou hiva,” chiin aphuong hi. Tuachi’n “Nou mipite zousie aw ka thugen chiemte un,” achibe nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa leh Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat, Ramoth Gilead ah akuontou ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel leengpa’n Jehoshaphat kungah; “Kei kisiemlamdangin galphuol ah ka lut dinga, nang pen in na leeng puontuol silin,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Israel leengpa akisiemlamdanga galphuol sungah alutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siria leengpa’n asakolleng hawl lamkaite thu apie a, “Israel leengpa chiloungal midang alien hiin aneu hitaleh koima kisatpi sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sakolleng hawl lamkaiten Jehoshaphat amu tah un “Israel leengpa hiva” achi ua, tuachi’n ama kisatpi ding in azuon ua, hinanleh akikoukhie a, Mangpa’n ama apanpi hi. Pasian in ama akipat in amaute aheimang paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua sakolleng hawl lamkaiten ama Israel leengpa ahisih chi atheitah un, ama adel nawnsih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh koi ahiei khat in athal kuoi a amawh kap leh, Israel leengpa awmphaw kisuhtuona kaaltah ah akapkha a, tuatahin leengpa’n asakolleng hawlpa kungah, “Kihei inlen galphuol apat in hing pawtkhietpi in, kaliemta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khummi ni sun nitum in kidouna ahuoise mama a, Israel leengpa asakolleng tunga kingam in Siriate lam ngain nitahlam dongin a umdenta hi. Nitum kuon tahin ashita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat Jerusalem a aleeng innpi ah damtah in akinuale kia tah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hanani tapa guolnei Jehu leengpa kimupi dingin ahing pawtdoh a, akungah, “Nang migilou panpi a, Mangpa mudate it ding na hiei mah? tuaziehin Mangpa thangpaina na tungah a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh nangma ah silhoi bangza ahiei a um hi, aziehpen gamsunga kipat in Ashera songlaite na paimanga, Pasian suina lam ah na lungtang na koi ziehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoshaphat Jerusalem ah atenga, tualeh Beersheba apat Ephraim singtang gam dongin mipite zousie kungah ava haw kia a, Mangpa apu apate uh Pasian lam ah amaute apui kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Juda gamsunga kulpinei khopi zousie ah, thukhen vaihawmte akoi chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh aman vaihawm mite kungah, “Na silbawlte uh pilvang tahin ngaituo un, mihing a dinga thukhen vaihawm na hi sih ua, Mangpa a dinga thukhen vaihawm na hi zaw uhi. Thukhenna na bawl pouma chiengun, Aman noute ahing umpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin Mangpa giinna na tung uah um hen, pilvangtah in thu khen un, aziehpen Mangpa i Pasian uah gitlouna aum sih a, mideisah tuomna leh golguhna zong aum sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Jehoshaphat in Jerusalem ah zong Levite, siempute leh Israel innkuonte lah a aphung sung ua upate, Mangpa dan dungzui a vaihawm ding leh thubuoite khen dingin mi akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman amaute kungah “Tam thupiehte apie a, Mangpa giinna toh muonhuoitah leh lungtang hoibukimtah in nna sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atenna khopite ua kipat a, na gammi hipite ua kipata thubuoi pouma sisan suona thu hitaleh, dan leh thupieh thu hitaleh, thuguot leh vaihawmna thu hitaleh ahing kitut pouma, Mangpa tunga khiellou dingin, amaute na vauhil ding uh ahi. Tuabanga na bawl sih u’leh, Ama thangpaina noute leh na sanggamte uh tungah ahing tungkha ding hi. Tami bawl un, na khiel sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa toh kisai thu zousie ah, siempu lien Amariah, noute tungah vaihawm ahi dinga, tualeh Lengpa toh kisai thu zousie ah Ishmael tapa Zebadiah, Juda nam lamkaipa khu noute tungah vaihawm ahi ding hi, tualeh Leviten zong noute mai ah u lien hina toh nna asem ding uhi. Hangsan tahin gamta unlen, asem hoite Mangpa’n umpi tahen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tamte nuain Moabmite leh Ammon mite’n Meun mite pawl khat toh Jehoshaphat tunga galbawl dingin ahing kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat ahing pei ua, Jehoshaphat kungah, “Nangma hing dou dingin galkaphon tampi, tuipi gal Asiria gam akipat in ahing kuon uhi, tuin Hazazon Tamar (tua khu En-gedi ahi) mun ah a umta uhi,” chi’n ava hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoshaphat apatau mama ta a, Mangpa thu doh ding atum chinten a, Juda gamsung zousie ah ann ngawl ding thu aphuongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda gam a mite zousie Mangpa akipat panpina sui dingin ahing peikhawm ua, Ahi, Mangpa sui dingin Juda gam khochin akipat ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoshaphat khu Juda leh Jerusalem mipi kikhawmte lah ah, Mangpa biehinn huong leituol tha mai ah adinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mangpa kapu ka pate uh Pasian aw, Nang vantunga um Pasian hilou na hiei mah? Nang namte leenggam zousie tungah vai na hawm a, silbawl theina leh thahatna na khut ah aum a, koiman ahing nang zou sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Koute Pasian aw, na mi Israelte masanga tam gam a tengte notdoh a, na lawmpa Abraham hahlesuonte kunga kumtawn a ama ua dinga na pieh hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaute tam gam ah atengta ua, na min dingin tam gam sungah munsiengthou khat a lam ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tung ua tuohsietna: namsau a vaihawmna ahiei, natna hipi ahiei ahisihleh kiel ahiei, ahing tun a ahileh, na umna, na min pua tami biehinn mai ah kang ding ding ua, chimaw in na kungah ka hing ki kou ding ua, na ngaikhe dinga, nang hundam ding hi achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin tanah Ammon, Moab leh Seir muol a kipan mite a um uhi. Israelte Izipt akipan a ahing pei lai un, agam uh dou dingin Israelte na phal sih hi, tuachi’n amaute apat akiheimang ua, asumang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin ang thuh dan uh en in, goutan dinga na hing pieh gam akipat nawdoh tum in ahing kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koute Pasian aw, amaute tunga gawtlou ding na hiei mah? Aziehpen koute dou dinga hing kuon tam galkaphon tampi maituo dingin kouten hatna ka nei sih ua, bang law ding ahiei chi zong ka thei sih uhi, hinanleh nangbou ka hing mit suon uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda mite zousie, a zi atate u’leh ata neute utoh khum mun a Mangpa mai ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levimi Asaph hahlesuon Mattaniah tapa, Jeiel tapa, Benaiah tapa, Zekariah tapa Jehaziel, tua mipi kikhawmte lah a adin lai in Mangpa Hagau atungah ahing tung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Aman leengpa Jehoshaphat leh Juda leh Jerusalem a tengte zousie aw na ngai un, Mangpa’n na kung uah tambangin agen hi; tam galkap hon tampite ziehin zau sih unlen, lungke vawt sih un, aziehpen kidouna noute a ahi sih a, Pasian a ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zing chiengin amauh dou dingin kuon suh un. Amaute Ziz muol a hing kaltou ding ahi ua, Jeruel gamdai gamgaw mai a luita tawpna lam ah amaute na mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam kidouna ah noute dou a akuul sih ding panmun khaw unlen, kip tahin ding unlen, Mangpa’n hundamna ahing pieh ding khu en un, Juda leh Jerusalemte aw zau sih unlen, lungke vawt sih un. Zing chiengin amaute tuoh dingin kuonkhie un, Mangpa’n hing umpi ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoshaphat amai a tuol suin akun a, Juda leh Jerusalem mite zousie zong Mangpa mai ah bohkhupin Ama abie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levimite a kipat kohath mite leh Korah mite pawl adingtou ua, Mangpa Israelte Pasian aw ngaitahin aphat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zingmawng matahin Tekoa gamdai zuon in akipan khie uhi. Akipat khieh laitah un Jehoshaphat ading doh a; “Juda leh Jerusalem mite aw hing ngaikhie un, Mangpa na Pasian uh muong un, tuachi’n na dingdet ding ua, aguolneite gingta un, tuachi’n na lawching ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mipite toh akithumu zouin Jehoshaphat in, galkap honte masanga peikawm a Mangpa sienthouna thupi mama zieh a, amai a lasa ding leh ama phat ding mite aguot a, “Mangpa phat un a itna kumtawn a um ding ahi ziehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabanga amauten la sah leh phat ahing pat tah un, Mangpa’n Juda gam dou dinga hingkuon Ammonte Moabte leh Seir muol a tengte, aguh a buh a dou ding akoi a, amaute zaw in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ammon mite leh Moab miten Seir muol a tengte sumang ding leh suchimit ding in ading khie uhi. Seir muola tengte athagam nua un, amauh kisumangthai tuo dingin akidou kia leu leu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Juda mite gamdai kimu suhna galvenna innsang lam zuon a ahing peilai un, tua galkap hon tampite agal et ua, ngai vawi, lei lah a mishi luong lum phengphung ngen a mu uhi. Asuohta mawngmawng aum sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoshaphat leh amite gallah sumte pawdingin ahing kuon ua, mishi luongte lah a kipat in galvan leh puonsil leh sil manpha tampi a puoh senglou uh amu uhi. Gallah sum atam seng senga, ni thum sung vingveng akhop tham uh aching hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani li niin amaute Berakah phaijang ah akikhawm ua, tuanah Mangpa aphat uhi. Tuaziehin tua mun khu tuni dongin Berakah phaijang akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoshaphat lamkai nain, Juda mite zousie leh Jerusalem khuo a tengte zousie kipahtahin Jerusalem ah akinuale kiata uhi. Aziehpen Mangpa’n amaute amelmate uh tungah kipahtahin a umsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amaute Jerusalem ah alut ua, kaigingte, gawsemte leh pengkul ging toh Mangpa biehinn ah apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mangpa’n Israelte adingin agalte uh adoupieh hi chi azah tah un, gamdang leenggam zousie tungah Pasian giinna atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n a Pasian in kil chintenga tawldamna apieh ziehin, Jehoshaphat leenggam sung galmuongin aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in Judate tungah vai ahawm a, Lenga apan chiil lai in kum sawmthum leh kum nga ahia, Jerusalem ah kum sawmni leh kumnga sung vai ahawm hi. Anu min Azubah ahia, Shilhi tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in apa Asa lampite azui a, tuate apielsan ngai sih a, Mangpa mitmuin sildih abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh mun sangte phietmang ahisih a, mipiten zong apu apate uh Pasian langah alungtangte uh a awnsah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehoshaphat vaihawm sunga siltung dangte abul apat atawp dong, Israel leengte khangthu gelna, Hanani tapa Jehu laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahun nukhia lam in Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat in Israel leengpa Ahaziah gitlouna a kheltah a gamtapa khu akizoppita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n summet bawlna tembaw hon khat bawlkhawm dingin thukimna abawla, Tamte zou in amaun Ezion-Geber ah tembawte abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mareshah aum Dodavahu tapa Eliezer in Jehoshaphat kalin thumavang agen a, “Ahaziah toh kizopna na bawl ziehin Mangpa’n na silbawlsate sumang ding ahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n tembawte akisie a, summet bawlna dingin tuitungah apei theita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoshaphat apu apate kungah a imuta a, David khopi ah apulepate kungah akivuita hi. Ama thahengin atapa Jehoram leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoram pienpi sanggamte, Jehoshaphat tapate anei a: Azariah, Jehiel, Zekariah, Azariah, Mikael leh Shephatiah: tamte zousie Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Apa un amaute kungah silpieh tampi, sana, dangka leh sil manphate leh Juda gam a khopi kulpi neite apie hi. Hinanleh Jehoram pen ata upapen ahi ziehin leenggam apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoram in apa leenggam ahing tanga, ahing kisuhdet tah in, asanggamte zousie namsauin athat sieng a, tualeh Israel gam a miliente pawlkhat zong athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoram leenga ahing pan chiil lai in, kum sawm thum leh kumni a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum giet sung vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman Ahab tanu zi a anei ziehin, Ahab innkuonte leh Israel leengte lampite a zui hi. Aman Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n David toh thuhun ana bawltah zieh in, Mangpa’n David leh ahahasuonte kunga mei vah khat apieh ut ziah in, David khanggui asumangthai ut sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoram vaihawm sungin Juda tungah Edom ahel a, aleengpa ding uh akibawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoram, amiliente leh a sakolleeng zousie toh khunah ava kuon a, Edom miten ama leh a sakolleng hawl lamkaite ana imkuol khum ua, hinanleh ama zankhang lai in athou khie a, Edom mite adouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Edom mite tuni dongin Judate tungah ahel ngitngetta uhi. Tua hun laima in Libnah zong Juda tungah ahel hi. Aziehpen Jehoram in Mangpa apu apate Pasian ataisan zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman Juda gam muol tungte ah mun sangte alam a, Jerusalem mite kizua sah a Judate alampiel sah zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehoram in guolnei Elijah akipat in laihah khat amu a, tambangin: na pa David Mangpa Pasian in thu agen hi. Na pa Jehoshaphat leh Juda leengpa Asa lampite na zui sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel leengte lampite na zui zaw a, Juda leh Jerusalem mite Ahab bawl bangin amaute ki zua dingin na lampiel sahta hi. Na sanggamte mama, na pa innkuonsung mite, nang sanga mi hoizawte nangawn na that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin Mangpa’n na mite, na tapate, na zite leh na nei-nalam zousie tungah gentheina gihtah hing tungsah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangma mama in zong sung natna damtheilou na nei dinga, na natna zieha ani ani a gilzam zousie alawtkhiet bei masangsie in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa’n Jehoram dou dingin Ethiopiamite toh kinai a teng Philistin mite leh Arab mite lungsim atohthouta, hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten Juda gam ahing sim ua, abulu ua, leengpa innpi sunga um vante zousie leh atapate leh azite nangawn toh apomang siengta uhi. Atapa tumpen Ahaziah loungal atapa dangte khat beeh zong anuasie sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam silte zousie nuain Mangpa’n Jehoram sunglam natna damtheilou in agawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hun hing pei zela, akum nina bei tahin, anatna ziehin agilzamte alawtkhie a, genthei tahin ashita hi. Amiten apu apate abawl bangun, ama zatatna tumphuolpi mei atawpiehta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawm thum leh kum ni a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum giet vai ahawm a, koima henla louin ashita a, David khopi ah akivui a, hinanleh leengte han ah aki vui sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem miten Jehoram tapa tumpen Ahaziah apa thahengin leeng in apang sahta uhi. Aziehpen Arabmite toh hing kuonkhawm galsim mite, agiehphuol ua hing lutten Jehoram tapa upa zawte zousie athat siengta uhi. Tuachi’n Jehoram tapa Ahaziah Judate leengpa’n apangsah ua vai ahawm panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawmni leh ni a upa ahia, Jerusalem ah kum khat sung vai ahawm hi. Anu min Athaliah ahia, Omri tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahaziah in zong Ahab innkuonte lampi azui a, aziehpen sil dihlou bawl dingin anu’n ama athusawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman Ahab innkuonte mabangin Mangpa mitmuin silgilou abawl hi, Aziehpen apa shi nuoin amaute asietna dinga thuhilmite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman athuhilnate uh azui a, Ramoth-gilead ah Siria leengpa Hazael dou dingin Israel leengpa Ahab tapa Joram toh akuon khawm a, khunah Siriaten Joram ana liem sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siria leengpa Hazael toh akidouna a, Ramah khuo a liemna atuoh ziehin Jezreel ah kisudam dingin akile kiata hi. Tualeh Juda leengpa Jehoram tapa Ahaziah zong Ahab tapa Joram damlou zieh a vave dingin Jezreel ah ahaw suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahaziah in Joram ava vena ziehin Pasian in Ahaziah tungah sietna atung sahta hi. Ahaziah ahing tuntah in, Nimsi tapa Jehu dou dingin Joram akuonkhie ua, Jehu pen Ahab innkuon sumang dinga Mangpa’n sathau anusa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehu in Ahab innkuonte tunga gawtna thukhenna atut laiin, Juda gam miliente leh Ahaziah nasem a unaute amukhie a, athatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahaziah sui dingin akuon a, a miten Samaria khuo a akibutna mun ah ava manta uhi. Jehu kungah ahing zawpi ua, athat ua, avuita uhi. “Amauten ama pen alungtang zousie toh Mangpa suipa Jehoshaphat tapa ahi” achi uhi. Tuachi’n Ahaziah innkuon sungah leenggam vaihawmna thaneina nei koima a um nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahaziah nu Athaliah in atapa ashita chi amu tahin, Juda leeng innkuon pumpi sumangthai dingin akipanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa Jehoram tanu Jehoseba in Ahaziah tapa Joash, tha dinga um leengpa tapate lah akipat agudoh a, ama leh nau donnu lupna pindan sung ah aphuol hi. Aziehpen leengpa Jehoram tanu, Ahaziah sanggamnu Jehoseba khu siempu Jehoiada zi ahi a, amanu’n Athaliah apat in naupang Joash aphuola, tha in a um kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Athaliah in tua gam a kum guh vai ahawm sung sie in, Pasian biehinn ah amaute toh Joash phuol in aum denta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Akum sagina kum in Jehoiada ahing kisuhat a, galkap zakhat tunga lamkaite, Jeroham tapa Azariah, Jehohanan tapa Ishmael, Obed tapa Azariah, Adaiah tapa Maaseiah leh Zikri tapa Elishaphat te toh thuhun abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amauten Juda gam sung zousie atuon suoh ua, khopite a kipat in Levite leh Israel innkuonte lah a upa pente, ava khawm ua, Jerusalem ah ahing tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipi kikhawmte zousie in Pasian biehinn ah leengpa toh thuhun abawl uhi. Jehoiada in amaute kungah; “Ngai un, Mangpa’n David hah lesuonte tungtanga ana chiemsa mabangin, leengpa tapa pen leengpa a apan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na bawl ding u’khu tami ahi: Nou siempute leh Levite, Khawl nia nasepna tangte sethum suo se khat kotkhapi ngah in pang unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh sethum suo sekhat leengpa innpi ah na um ding ua, sethumsuo sekhat dangte pen kulpi kotpi ah na um ding uhi, tualeh mipi zousie Mangpa biehinn huong sungah a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nasem a um siempute leh Levite chi loungal koima Mangpa biehinn sung alut ding uh ahi sih hi, amaute pen akisusiengthou ahi zieh un alut thei ding uhi, hinanleh midangte pen Mangpa’n veng dinga aguotna mun aveng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levite leengpa kimkot ah aum ding ua, mi chin in a galvan atawi chiet ding ua, koipou biehinn sunga hing lut pouma tha ding ahi. Lengpa peina tengah, akung nai ah um zing un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levimite leh Judamite zousie in Siempu Jehoiada in thu apieh dungzui in abawl ua, mi chin in khawl ni a lut ding leh pawt ding ami chiet uh akipui uhi, aziehpen siempu Jehoiada in apawl pawl a nasepna atawpsah nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Jehoiada in galkap zatel tunga lamkaite kungah, Mangpa biehinn sunga um, leengpa David neisa teipite lum lien leh neute ape chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tambangin Jehoiada in mi zousie leengpa kimkot ah maitam kung leh biehinn kim a, amauh pan mun dinga aguotna mun chiet ah, akhut ua galvan tawi kawm chietin akoi hi. Biehinn simlam panga kipat amallam dongin apang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jehoiada leh atapaten leengpa tapa Joash ahing puidoh ua, leenglukhu akhusah ua, theipina thuhun kiteikhie khat apie ua, leengpa ahi chin aphuong kheta uhi. Ama sathau anu ua, “Lengpa damsawt hen,” chiin akikouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Athaliah in mipite tai duomduom leh leengpa kipahpina husa azah tahin, Mangpa biehinn sunga mipite kungah ava haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amanu’n a et leh biehinn lutna a Sutpi kungah leengpa adinga, miliente leh pengkul mutte leengpa kungah aum uhi, tualeh gamsung mipite zousie akipah ua, pengkulte amut uhi, lasa miten tumgingte toh thuoin phatna ma akai uhi. Tuachi’n Athaliah in apuonsilte abotkeh a, “Phielguhna phielguhna,” chiin akikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siempu Jehoiada in galkap za tunga lamkaite asawlkhie a, akung uah, “Mipite kikaal akipat Athaliah hing puidoh unlen, amanu zui pouma namsau in that un,” achi hi. Aziehpen siempuin amanu “Mangpa biehinn sungah that sih un,” anachi zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa inn zotna sakol kotkha lutna mun ahing tuntahin Athaliah aman ua, tua mun ah athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoiada in ama leh mipite leh leengpa kikaal ah Mangpa mite hiding chiin thuhun khat abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite zousie akuon ua Baal biehna inn asuchim ua, amaitamte leh milimte asat guoi ua, tua maitamte mai ah Baal siempu Mattan athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoiada in, Mosi dan laibu a kigiel bang a, kipahtah a lasa kawm a, David in Mangpa biehinn a Mangpa kunga halmang sillatte lan dinga ana guot siempu Levimite khut a David in thu ana pieh dungzui a Mangpa biehinn kepna nasep siempute khuta ana koi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman sienthoulouna nei mi pouma asunga alut louna dingin Mangpa biehinn kotpite ah kotkha vengmite zong akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman galkap za tel tunga lamkaite leh miliente, mipi tunga vaihawmte tualeh gamsunga mipi zousie azawpi a, Mangpa biehinn akipat in leengpa apuisuh uhi. Amaute kotpi sahta zaw tawn in leengpa innsung ah alut ua, leengtoupha tungah leengpa atousah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gamsung mipite zousie lungnuom in akipah mama uhi. Athaliah tha a aumtah ziehin khopi sung zong adai a, asipta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joash leenga apan chiillai in kum sagi a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmli sung vai ahawm hi. Anu min Zibia ahi a, Beersheba mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siempu Jehoiada damsung teng Joash in Mangpa mitmu ah sildih abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoiada in amapa zi ni aneisah a, tapate leh tanute anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hun bangtan ahiei nua in, Joash in Mangpa biehinn puophat ding lungsim ahing neita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman siempute leh Levite ahankhawm a, akung uah, Juda gam a khopite ah “Vahaw unlen, na Pasian uh biehinn puophatna dingin, Israel mite zousie kum chin a apieh ding uh sumte va dongkhawm un, tu mama in bawl pai un,” achi hi. Hinanleh Leviten abawl pai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin leengpa’n siempu lienpen Jehoiada ahan a, akungah, “Bangzieh a Mangpa suohpa Mosi leh Israel kikhawmpiten theipina biehbuh a dinga sie sum apieh ding ua kiguotsate, Juda gam leh Jerusalem akipat dongkhawm dinga Levite phutlou na hiei,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen tua numei gilounu Athaliah tapaten Pasian biehinn asuseta ua, Mangpa inn adinga kilan siengthou sate nangawn Baalte a dingin ana zang siengta uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lengpa thupiehin sumbawm khat abawl ua, Mangpa biehinn kotpi ah akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda gamsung pumpi leh Jerusalem ah, Pasian suohpa Mosi in gamdai a, Israelten apieh chiet ding ua aphut sie sum Mangpa a dinga hing tawi dingin thuphuon khat akibawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miliente zousie leh mipite zousie in kipahtahin amauh thaw dingte ahing tawi ua, tua sumbawm sungah adim masang sie’n akhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leviten leengpa miliente kunga, tua sumbawm ahing puohlut pouma chiengun, tualeh sum tampi aum chi amu chiengun leengpa laigielpa leh siempulienpa nasempa ahing pei ua, tua sumbawm asuokhie ua, akoina mun ngai ah akoi kia zel uhi. Ni sim in hichibangin abawl ua, sum tampi akhonkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lengpa leh Jehoiada in, Mangpa biehinn puophat kul bang banga nasem mite kung leh, Mangpa biehinn lamtha kia dinga kiguoi suongkheng siemte leh singbawl siemte, tualeh Mangpa biehinn siemphatna dinga sia leh sum-eng khengsiem mite kungah apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n nasem miten kukal tahin nna asem ua, azouta uhi, tualeh Pasian inn angaima bangin atungding kia ua, asuhat ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na sep azaw siengtah un, sum val teng leengpa leh Jehoiada kungah ahing tawi ua, tuate in Mangpa biehinn ading vanzahte abawl uhi. Tualeh halmang sillata zah ding sana leh dangka akibawl bel leh kuongte zong abawl uhi. Tuachi’n Jehoiada damsung sie in Mangpa biehinn ah halmang sillalte alan ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin Jehoiada ahing upata a, ateh mama ta hi, kum za leh sawmthum aphah in ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasian leh abiehinn a dinga Israelte lah a anasep hoite ziehin, David khopi ah, leengte lah ah avui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada shi nua in, Juda miliente ang pei ua leengpa kung ah zana ahing pie ua, tuachi’n leengpa’n athu uh ana ngaikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amauten Mangpa apa apate uh Pasian biehinn nuasie in Ashera songlaite leh milimte abeta uhi. Tambanga akhelnate zieh un Juda gam leh Jerusalem tungah Mangpa thangpaina ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa’n amaute akung a nua pui kia dingin, mipite kungah guolneite sawl in, amauten akhelnate uh theisah nan u’leh zong, angaikhe nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa hagau siempu Jehoiada tapa Zekariah tungah ahing tungta hi. Zekariah, mipite masang ah adinga, akung uah, “Tami Pasian thugen ahi, Bangdinga nouten Mangpa thupiehte zuilou na hi uoi? Na lamzang sih ding uhi, Ama na taisantah ziehun, Aman zong noute ahing taisanta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh ama kalin thu adap phiel ua, leengpa thupieh in Mangpa biehinn huongsung ah ama suongin aseplumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leengpa Joash in, atunga Zekariah pa Jehoiada hepinate athei ngitnget sih a, atapa athatta mawh hi. Zekariah in ashi ding kuon in “Mangpa’n tami mu henlen, phuba lata hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, kum bei kuon in Siria galkapte Joash dou ding in ahing kuon ua, Juda gam leh Jerusalem ahing sim ua, mipi lamkaite athatta uhi. Tualeh a gallah sumte zousie uh, Damaska a leengpa kung ah ahahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Siria galkapte tawmnoukhat hing kuon hinanleh zong, Mangpa’n amaute khut sung ah atam zaw, tham galkap honte apie hi. Aziehpen Juda in Mangpa apu apate uh Pasian ataisan zieh ua, Joash tunga gawtna tung ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siriate anuakia tah un, Joash zong nasatah a liem in anuasie uhi. Ama miliente mama in, Jehoiada tapate phuba lahna in atungah thu aphielgu ua, alupna tungah athatta uhi. Tuachi’n ashita a, David khopi ah akivui a, hinanleh leengte han ah akivui sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama tunga thu phielgute khu tamte ahi uhi. Ammon numei Shimeath tapa Zabad leh Moab numei Shimrith tapa Zehozabad, ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joash tapate tungtang thute leh, ama tungtang genlawhnate, Pasian biehinn alamtha thute leengte khangthu kigelna laibu ah akigiel hi. Ama thahengin atapa Amaziah leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amaziah leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawmni leh kum nga a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmni leh kuo sung vai ahawm hi. Anu min Jehadin ahi a, Jerusalem mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman Mangpa mitmu in sildih abawl a, hinanleh alungtang zousie toh abawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aleenggam ama thuneina nuoi a sudet ahi tahin, apa that amiliente athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh atapate uh athat sih a Mosi dan laibu a kigiel bangin, tate zieh a pate ashi ding ahi sih a, “Pate zieh a tate zong ashi ding ahi sih hi, hinanleh michin ama khelna zieh a ashi ding ahi, chi a Mangpa thupieh bangin agamta zaw hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaziah in Juda gam mite ahankhawm a, Juda leh Benjamin mite zousie adingin ainnkuon uh tul tungah leh za tungah galkap lamkai abawl hi. Tuachi’n aman kum sawmni apat atunglam zousie asim a, galdouna a pang thei, teipi leh lum zang thei, galkap tul za thum apha hi chi amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman dangka sia talent za khat in, Israel akipat galdou siem mi tul zakhat zong aguoi nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian mi khat akungah ahing haw a, “Lengpa aw, Israel apat a hing kuon galkapte nangtoh kuon khawm sih uheh, aziehpen Mangpa’n Israelte a umpi sih a, Ephraim mi khat beh zong umpi lou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kidouna ah hangsantahin pang nanlachin zong Pasian in na melmate masangah ahing guollel sah veve ding hi, azieh pen Pasian in panpi theina leh guollel sah theina, thahatna anei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaziah in Pasian mipa kungah, “Israel galkapte ka goina talent za khat ka pieh bang chita ding adiei?” chiin adong hi. Pasian mipa’n adawnga “Mangpa’n tua sanga tamzaw hing pethei ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amaziah in Ephraim akipat a hing kuon galkapte atawp sah a, ainn lam uah apei sahta hi. Tuachi’n amaute Juda tungah alungthah mama ua, thangpai tahin innlam ah anua peita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amaziah akisuhat a, agalkapte chi phaijang ah azawpi suh a, khunah Seir mi tul sawm athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda galkapten zong mi tul sawm ahingmat ua kawltung khat ah azawpi ua, asawnkhie ua, tuachi’n abawn un akitat guoi dimdem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuahunsung mama in, Amaziah in kidouna, apansah utlou a, anua sawl kia galkap honten Juda khopite, Samaria akipat Beth-Horon dong ana bulu ua, mi sangthum athat ua, gallah sum tampi apomang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaziah Edommite that zou a ahing kinuale kia tahin, Seir mite pasiente ahing puo a, ama pasiente dingin atunga, amaute bie in akun a, amasang uah gimnamtuite ahal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amaziah tungah Mangpa lungthahna akuongta a, akungah guolnei khat asawl a, aman: “Na khut a kipata amauh mite mama bawn hundoh theilou mite pasiente bangdinga thu dong mawngmawng na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuabanga thu agenzinglai in, leengpa’n akungah, “Leengpa thuhil dingin nang koi hing guot ahiei? tawp in, bang dinga satpua a um ding na hiei mah?” achi hi. Tuachi’n guolneipa atawp a, hinanleh akungah, “Tam sil na bawl zieh leh kang thuhilna na ngaikhieh utlou ziehin, Pasian in nang hing suhmang tum chinten ahi, chi ka thei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda leengpa Amaziahin ama thuhil mite, akikuppi nua in, Jehu tupa Jehoahaz tapa Israel leengpa Jehoash kungah tambanga phinna thu ahah a, “Hing pei inlen kimaituo in hing kimupi in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel leengpa Jehoash in Juda leengpa Amaziah kungah, “Lebanon a lingkungin, Lebanon a sidar sing kungah, ka tapa zi dingin na tanu hing pie in achi a, tuazou in Lebanon gamsa hang khat ahing pei a, lingkung khu atuonchilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai in, Edommite ka zouta na ki chi a, na lungsim in na ki uongsah a, na kisathei hi. Hinanleh inn ah um khin khian in; Bangdinga buoina ngen a nangma leh Juda gam sietna ding sui a kitahla na hiei?” chi in mi asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Amaziahin angaikhe nuom sih hi. Aziehpen Edommite pasiente abiehtah zieh ua, amelmate uh khuta, apieh khieh theina dinga, Pasian in tuabanga ana bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa Jehoash in adouta hi. Ama leh Judate leengpa Amaziah, Juda gam a Beth-Shemesh ah akimaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte mai ah Judate aguollelta ua, michin ainn lam chiet uah ataita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel leengpa Joash in Juda leengpa Amaziah, Joash tapa, Jehoahaz tapa Beth-Shemesh ah aman a, Jerusalem ah ahing zawpi a, Jerusalem kulbang Ephraim kotpi akipat aninga kotpi dong tong za li vel a sau asat chim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa biehinn sunga um amu pouma sana leh dangka zousie leh um leh bel zousie akempa Obed-edom pum in, amankhawm a, tualeh leengpa inn sunga gou umte leh ami matte zong apokhawm a, Samaria ah aki nuale kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Juda leengpa Joash tapa Amaziah, Israel leengpa Jehoahaz tapa Jehoash shi nua in kum sawm leh kum nga adam nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaziah vaihawm sunga siltung dangte, abul apat atawp dong, Juda leengte leh Israel leengte khangthu gelna laibu sungah akigiel hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amaziah in Mangpa akiheisan akipat in amiten Jerusalem ah ama aphielgu ua, ama Lakish ah atai hi. Hinanleh Lakish tandong ama nuadel ding mi asawl ua, tuanah athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama khu sakol in ava nua puoh kia ua, Juda khopi a apu leh pate kungah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda mipite zousie in kum sawm leh guh a upa Uzziah apui ua, apa Amaziah mun ah leengpa in abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lengpa Amaziah apu apate kunga a imut nua in Uzziah in Eloth alamtha kia a, Juda gam a dingin alakia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzziah leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawm leh guh a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmnga leh kum ni vai ahawm hi. Anu min Jakoliah ahi a, Jerusalem mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Uzziah in apa Amaziah bangin, Mangpa mitmu ah sildih abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian giindan ama hilpa Zekariah damsung in Uzziah in Pasian asui a, Mangpa asui sung tengin Pasian in ama lawchinna apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzziah akuondoh a, Philistinte ava dou a, Gath, Jabneh leh Ashdod kulbangte ava satchim hi. Tuachi’n aman Ashdod gam leh Philistinte lah ah khopite alamtha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasian in ama, Philistinte leh Gur-bal a teng Arabte leh Meun mite lah ah apanpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ammon miten Uzziah kungah Sie apie ua, tuachi’n athahat mama tah ziehin, aminthanna in Izipt gamgi dong azel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uzziah in Jerusalem ah, Aning a kotpi ah, Guom kotpi leh kulpi bang kawina ning kiu te ah innsang alam a, kulbangin a imkhum nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamdai ah inn sangte alam a, tuikhuh te atou hi, aziehpen aman muolbulte leh phaijang ah ganhon tampi anei hi. Muoltungte leh Karmel ah lou bawl mite leh grep huonte kem ding mi zong akoi hi. Aziehpen ama loubawl lam a lunglut mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uzziah in galdou dan kizil siemsa galkapte ahon hon a kuondoh thei dinga mansa zong anei hi. Tuate atam dan uh dungzui in, laigielpa Jeiel leh vaihawmpa Maaseiah in, leengpa galkap lamkai Hananiah thupieh dungzui a a sim detdet uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aphung sung upa pente u’lah a, galdou thei mihat hangsan chiet tul ni leh zaguh apha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaute lamkaina nuoi ah kidou dinga chiilsiemsa galkap pawl tul za leh tul sagi leh zanga a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Uzziah in galkapte zousie a dingin, lumte, teipite, sia lukhute, awmphawte, thalpite leh suong kapna ding sailite, abawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman Jerusalem ah, khutsiemte bawl thalkap dohna ding leh suongtumte khiehkhumna ding, khawlte innsang tungte leh kulbang ning kiute ah akoi hi. Tuachi’n gam pumpi ah aminthangta hi, aziehpen ama thahat tah ahing hi masang sie in, panpina nasatah pieh in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Uzziah ahing hat mama tah in, ahing kisatheita a, alungtang kisahtheina in apuana atun hi. Aziehpen Mangpa a Pasian tungah amuonhuoita sih a, gimnamtui halna maitam tunga, gimnamtui hal dingin, Mangpa biehinn sungah alut ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Azariah in, Mangpa siempu hangsan dang sawm giette toh ama azui lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaun leengpa Uzziah adal ua, akungah, “Uzziah, Mangpa mai a gimnamtui hal ding nang tanvou ahi sih hi. Tam pen Aaron hahlesuon siempute, gimnamtui hal dinga kisiensuote bawl ding ahi bou hi, munsiengthou akipat pawtdoh in, na gamta khielta hi. Mangpa Pasian in nang hing zatat bawl nawn lou ding ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Uzziah akhut a gimnamtui halna belkuong tawisa a, haldinga mansa a umlai, alungthahta hi. Mangpa biehinn sunga, gimnamtui halna mai a, siempute tunga, alungthah laitah in, atalpang ahing phata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siempu lienpen Azariah leh siempu dangte zousie in ama a et u’leh, atalpang ah phahna aumta chi amu ua, tuachi’n ama apawtdoh sah pai uhi. Mangpa’n a gawt tah ziehin ama zong kintah a pawtdoh a utta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Uzziah ashi dongin apha a, aphah tah ziehin inn tuom ah atenga, Mangpa biehinn a kipat puse ahita a, tuachi’n atapa Jotham in leeng innpi angah a, gamsung mite vai ahawm piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Uzziah vaihawm sunga siltung dangte abul akipat atawp dong, Amos tapa guolnei Isai in agiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Uzziah apu apate kungah a imuta a, leengte kivuina mun ah, amaute kung nai ah akivui hi, amaun, ama khu “Aphah ahi” achi zieh uh ahi. Tuachi’n atapa Jotham ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jotham leeng a apan chiil lai in kum sawmni leh kum nga a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh guh sung vai ahawm hi. Anu min Jerusha ahi a, Zadok tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jotham in apa Uzziah bawl bangin, Mangpa mitmu ah sildih abawl a, hinanleh apa bawl bangin, Mangpa biehinn ah alut ngai sih hi. Hinanleh mipiten silhoilou lam ngen abawl nalai lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jotham in Mangpa biehinn kotpi sahta zaw abawltha a, tualeh Ophel kulbang tungah zong inn tampi alam be hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Juda singtang gamte ah khopite alam a, gammang lah ah zong kulte leh innsangte alam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jotham in Ammon mite tungah gal abawla, amauh azou hi. Tuami kum in Ammon miten ama kungah dangka sia talent zakhat mangbu bu, atena kor tul sawm leh barli bu atena kor tul sawm apie uhi. Akum nina leh akum thumna ah zong tuazama apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa a Pasian mai a alampite abawlphat zieh in Jotham ahing thahat deu deuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jotham vaihawm sunga siltung dangte, agaldouna zousie leh siltung dangte, Israel leh Juda leengte khangthu gelna laibu sungah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jotham leenga apan chiil lai in, kum sawmni leh kum nga a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh guh sung vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jotham apu apate kungah a imuta a, David khopi ah akivuita hi. Atapa Ahaz in amun alua a, leeng in ahing pangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaz leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawmni a upa ahia, Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh guh vai ahawm hi. Hinanleh apu David bangin Mangpa mitmuin sildih abawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen aman Israel leengte umdan azui a, Baalte biehna dingin sunthaw milimte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman Hinnom tapa phaijang ah kithoinate ahal a, Mangpa’n Israelte mai a anawdoh namte chindan kidahhuoi zui in, atapate mei a, hallumin kithoina abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Muoltungte ah mun sangte leh singbawhpha nuoi chinteng ah, kithoinate alan a, gimnamtuite ahal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa a Pasian in ama, Siria leengpa khut ah ape khie a, Siriaten ama azou ua, amite tampi sal in apuimang ua, Damaska khopi ah apuitung uhi. Tualeh Israel leengpa khut sungah zong piehkhiet in aum a, Israelten zong amite tampi athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni khat sungin Remaliah tapa Pekah in Juda gam ah galkap tul zaleh tul sawmni athat hi. Juda gam in Mangpa apu apate uh Pasian ataisan tah zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Ephraim mite lah a galdou hangsan khat Zikri in leengpa tapa Maaseiah leh leengpa innsung a vaihawm lien Azrikam leh leengpa zom a lienpen Elkanah athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israelten a unaute uh Juda numei leh atapate u’leh atanute uh tul zani galhing in aman uhi, tualeh gallah vante tampi zong ala ua, Samaria ah apuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa guolnei khat khunah aum a, amin Obed ahi, Samaria a hing kinuale kia galkapte dawn dingin akuonkhie hi. Aman akung uah, “Mangpa napu napate uh Pasian Judate tunga alungthah ziehin Aman amaute na khut sung uah ahing pekhie hi, tualeh nouten thangpai tah in amaute na that ua, tua khu van ah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin Juda leh Jerusalem numeite leh pasalte suoh leh sal a bawl na sawm uhi, hinanleh noute ngel zong Mangpa na Pasian uh tunga khelna nei hilou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin ka thu ngaikhie unlen, na unaute uh sal a na matte uh hadoh kia un, aziehpen Mangpa lungthahna zauhuoi tah na tung uah aum hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ephraim mite lah a lamkai pawl khat, Jehohanan tapa Azariah, Meshillemoth tapa Berekiah, Shalum tapa Jehizkiah leh Haldai tapa Amasa ten galdouna mun akipat a hing tungte ana maituo ua, akung uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na salmatte uh tam mun a na hing tut lou ding uh ahi; Mangpa mai a isuhkhelnate ban ah, ikhelnate leh ibawlsietnate belap na tum nalai uh amah? Aziehpen i khelnate uh alien sengta a, Israelte tungah Ama lungthahna zauhuoitah aum hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkapten miliente leh mipi kikhawmte mai ah asalmatte u’leh agallah vante uh anuasieta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amin a kihan a nasep ding kiguotte adingdoh ua, salmatte azawpi ua, gallah vante lah a kipat puonsilte ala ua, guohtang a umte a silsah ua, kedap abun sah ua, neh leh dawn ding leh kizutdamna ding damdawi apie uhi, ahatlou leh azawngkhalte zousie sabiltung tungah apuo ua, Tumsing khopi Jerikou ah, a unaute u’kungah ava nua koi kiata uhi. Tuachi’n Samaria ah akinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuami hun lai in leengpa Ahaz in Asiria leengpa kungah panpina ngen dingin mi asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Edom mite ahing kuon kia ua, Juda gam ahing dou ua, sal in apuimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Philistinten zong mun ngiem gam leh Juda simlam gam a khopite ahing sim ua, Beth-Shemesh, Aijalon Gederoth, Sokoh leh akimvel a akhoneute toh, Timnah leh akimvel a akhoneute toh, tualeh Gimzo leh akim vela akhoneute toh, ala ua, khunah atengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel leengpa Ahaz ziehin Mangpa’n Juda gam asungiemta hi; aziehpen aman Juda gam gitlouna gasuo in aum sah a, Mangpa tungah muonhuoilou in a um sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asiria leengpa Tilgath Pileser akungah ahing haw a hinanleh panpina pieh nahsangin ahing subuoi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahaz in Mangpa biehinn akipat leh leengpa innpi a kipat leh amiliente inn akipat in silte ala khawm a, Asiria leengpa kungah apie hi, hinanleh ama adingin aphatuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lengpa Ahaz alungkham a abuoi hun chiengin Mangpa tungah amuonhuoi maw semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama nuoisie Damaskate pasiente mai ah kithoinate alan hi. “Aman Asiria leengte pasienten amauh apanpi zel a, tuaziehin kei zong ahing panpi na ding un, akung uah ka kithoi ding hi,” achi hi. Hinanleh amaute ama leh Israelte zousie sietna ahing hi zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahaz in Pasian biehinn sunga kipat in, vanzah bel leh kuongte zousie alakhawma asat guoi sieng a, Mangpa biehinn kotpite akha a, Jerusalem kholai ning kawi chinteng ah maitamte adaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Juda gam a khopi chintengah, pasien dangte mai a kithoina gimnamtui halna dingin mun sangte abawla, tuachi’n Mangpa apu leh pate Pasian alungthah sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama vaihawm sunga siltung dangte leh agamtatna zousie abul akipat atawp dongin, Juda leh Israel leengte khangthu gelna laibu sungah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahaz apu apate kungah a imuta a, Jerusalem khopi ah avuita uhi. Hinanleh Israel leengte han sungah asiel sih uhi. Atapa Hezekiah in amun aluo a leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekia leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawmni leh kum nga a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmni leh kum kuo vai ahawm hi. Anu min Abijah ahi a, Zekariah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman apu David in ana bawl zousie bangin Mangpa mitmu ah sildih a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman avaihawm kum, kum khatna, hakhatna ah, Mangpa biehinn kotkhate ahonga, abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siempute leh Levi mite ahing puiluta, suolam panga mun jang ah akikhawm sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute kungah, “Hing ngaikhie un, Nou Levimite aw tuin kisiensuo unlen, Mangpa na pu napate uh Pasian biehinn siensuo un. Tualeh mun siengthou a kipat kisuhbua na silte zousie sumang sieng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I pu ipate ana muonhuoi sih ua, Mangpa i Pasian uh mitmuin silgilou ana bawl ua, Ama ana taisanta uhi. Mangpa tenna mun akipat amaitang te uh alengatsah ua, Ama anua ngatsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biehinn kotkhate akha ua, meivahte amit sahta uhi. Tualeh Israelte Pasian kungah, gimnamtuite ahal nawn sih ua, munsiengthou ah halmang sillatte zong alan nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin Juda tung leh Jerusalem tungah Mangpa lungthahna atungta a, na mit ua na mu bangun, aman amaute khu buoina chizatna leh enghouna dingin apekheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamte zieh in ahi ipu ipate uh namsau a ana puana u’leh itapate leh itanute u’leh izite uh suoh leh sal a ana kimatna uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Alungthahna zauhuoi tahin eite ahing kiheimangsan theina dingin, tuin Israelte Mangpa Pasian toh thuhun bawl ka lungtang ah aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tapate aw tuin ngaisah louin um sih un, Mangpa’n ama mai a ding ding leh ama bie a, anasem ding leh gimnamtuite hal dingin ahing tel ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam Leviten nna asem panta uhi. Amaute: Kohath mite akipat in, Amasai tapa Mahath leh Azariah tapa Joel, Merari mite akipat in, Abdi tapa Kish leh, Jehalelel tapa Azariah; Gershon mite akipat in: Zimmah tapa Joah leh Joah tapa Eden.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elizaphan hahlesuonte akipat in: Shimri leh Jeiel, Asaph hahlesuonte akipat in: Zekariah leh Mattaniah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Heman hahlesuonte akipat in: Jehiel leh Shimei; Jeduthun hahlesuonte akipat in: Shemiah leh Uziel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asanggamte uh akhopkhawm ua, akisiensuo zou tah un, Mangpa thu a leengpa thupieh dungzui in, Mangpa mun siengthou susieng dingin alut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siempute Mangpa biehinn ah, susieng dingin alut ua, Mangpa biehinn sunga sil sienglou zousie Mangpa biehinn pulam ah alakhie uhi. Tuate khu Levimiten ala ua, kidron lui guom lam ah azawngdoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaun hakhatna nikhat ni in siensuona nasep apan ua, tuami ha ni gietni in Mangpa innhim ah ahing tung uhi. Ni giet dang sungin Mangpa biehinn asiensuo uhi; Aha khatna ni sawm leh guh niin azou sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Hezekiah kungah ava pei ua, anasep thu uh ava hil uhi: “Mangpa biehinn abawn in ka siengsahta ua, halmang sillatna maitam leh abel akuongte leh tanghou siengthou koina dawkan, leh avanzahte zousie toh ka siengsahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lengpa Ahaz, leenga apan lai a, amuonhuoilou zieh a, alah khiet bel leh kuongte zousie zong ka bawlpha ua, ka susiengthouta uhi. Tuate tuin Mangpa maitam mai ah a um siengta uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n azing ni zingmawng matah in leengpa Hezekiah in, khopi vaihawm liente ahankhawma, Mangpa biehinn ah apeitoupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amauten leenggam a ding leh munsiengthou a ding leh Judate a dinga khelna sillat dingin, bawngtal sagi, belam nou sagi, belamtal sagi leh keltal sagi ahing kai uhi. Lengpa’n Aaron hahlesuon siempute kungah, Mangpa maitam tunga lan dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n bawngtalte athat ua, siemputen asisan ala ua, maitam tungah athe uhi; tuamabangin belam talte athat ua asisan maitam tungah athe uhi, belam noute zong athat ua asisan maitam tungah athe uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh khelna sillat ding keltalte, leengpa mai leh mipi kikhawmte mai ah ahing kai ua, amaun atung uah akhutte uh anga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n siemputen tua keltal sagite athat ua, Israel mi zousie adinga khelna tatdohna kithoina dingin, maitam tungah asisan un kilemna abawl uhi; aziehpen leengpa’n halmang sillat leh khelna sillat, Israel mizousie a dinga lan dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman David leh leengpa guolnei Gad leh guolnei Nathan thupieh dung zui in, Mangpa biehinn ah Levimite, dah khutbehte, kaigingte leh pehgingte tawi in a umna mun chiet uah akoi hi, tambanga bawl khu aguolneite tungtawn a Mangpa thu pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n David tumgingte tawi in Levite mansa in ading ua, siempute zong apengkulte uh tawi in ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hezekiah in maitam tunga halmang sillatte lan dingin thu apie hi. Tua halmang sillat akipat tahin, Pengkul gingte leh leengpa David tum gingte toh Mangpa phatna lasah zong akipan pai ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi kikhawmte zousie Pasian bie in akuun ua, lasaten la asa ua, Pengkul mutten pengkulte amut uhi. Halmang sillatte akizaw masang sie in tambang biehna zousie apeitou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sillalte azaw tah un, leengpa leh akunga um mi zousie akhupdin ua, Pasian abie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lengpa Hezekiah leh ami lienten, David leh guolnei asaph in aphuo uh Mangpa phatna lasa dingin Levite thu apie uhi. Tuachi’n amauten kipahtahin phatna la asa ua, alu uh kun in Pasian abie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah in adawnga, “Tuin Mangpa adingin na kisiensuota ua, Hing pei unlen Mangpa biehinn ah, kithoinate leh kipah thugen na sillatte hing tawi un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n mipi kikhawmte kithoinate leh kipah thugenna sillatte ahing tawi ua, tualeh lungtanga kiphalna nei pouma in halmang sillatte ahing tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mipi kikhawmten halmang sillat ahing tawite uh bawngtal sawm sagi, belamtal zakhat, belamnou atal zani apha hi. Tamte zousie Mangpa mai a, halmang sillat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kithoina dinga kisiensuo ganta zousie abawn in bawngtal za guh, belam leh kel tul thum apha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh tua halmang sillat zousie vun hawh dingin siempute atawm seng ua, tuazieh in a unaute uh Leviten, tua nasep akizaw masang sie in leh siempu dangte akisiensuo masang sie un apanpi uhi. Aziehpen kisiensuo thu ah siempute sangin Leviten sielepha theina siengtah toh agamta zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Halmang sillatte atam mama ban ah, lemna sillat sathaute leh dawn sillatte toh sim in sillat atam mama hi. Tuachi’n Mangpa biehinn a nasepna akisiempha kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pasian in mipite tambang silte thakhat a bawldoh thei dinga apanpi zieh in leengpa Hezekiah leh mipite akipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekia in Israel leh Juda gam sung pumpi ah thu ahah a, Ephraim leh Manasseh te kung ah zong lai ahah a, Mangpa Israelte Pasian kunga peikan pawi lopna mang dinga, Jerusalem a Mangpa biehinn a hing haw dingin chielna abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lengpa leh amiliente leh Jerusalem a kikhawmte’n ha nina a peikan pawi bawl dingin thupuana abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kisiensuosa siempu kiching a umlou zieh leh mipiten Jerusalem a kikhopna aneilou zieh un ahun ngaina in pawi ana nei thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam asil sawm uh, leengpa leh mipiten dih asa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel gamsung pumpi, Beer-Sheba a kipat Dan tandonga mite Jerusalem a hing pei a, Mangpa Israelte Pasian kunga Peikan pawi lopna hing zou dinga hatna thuphuon bawl ding pha asata uhi. Aziehpen akigielsa dungzui in mi tampi in, hun sawttah tuabangin abawl nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lengpa thupieh bangin, laihah paw miten, leengpa leh miliente a kipat laihah khu, “Israel leh Juda gam sung pumpi a hawm dingin akuonta uhi. Laihah khu tambangin aki giel hi: ‘Israel mipite Asiria leengte khuta kipata suohta sun noute kunga, Mangpa Abraham leh Isaak leh Israel Pasian ahing kinua leh kia theina dingin, noute ama kunglam ah nuakia kia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noute, na pu na pate u’leh na sanggamte uh bang sih un. Amaute pen Mangpa apu apate uh Pasian tungah ana muonhuoi tasih ua, Aman na mu bangun chizatna mite asuoh sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na pu napate uh bangin genha sih unlen, Mangpa kungah kitulut un. Aman kumtawn a dinga asiensuo sa, amunsiengthou ah lut un. Alungthahna zauhuoitah noute akipat akiheimang theina dingin Mangpa na Pasian uh nna sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa kunga na hing kinuahei kia u’leh, na sanggamte u’leh na tate uh tungah, amauh sal a puite’n lainatna anei ding ua, tam gam ah ahing nuapei kia ding uhi; aziehpen Mangpa na Pasian u’khu hepisiem, leh lainatna hau ahi. Ama kunga na hing kinuale u’leh ahing kiheisan vawt sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Laihah pawte khu khopi chin ah aban ban in Ephraim leh Manasseh gam pumpi ah, Zebulun tandong in apei ua, hinanleh miten amauh ana engbawl ua, ana nuisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Asher leh Manasseh leh Zebulun mi lawikhatte akingiemkhieh ua Jerusalem ah ahaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda gam ah zong, Mangpa thu a, leengpa leh miliente thupieh zui ding leh lungsim mun khat posah dingin Pasian khut mipite tungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aha ni na ah, tanghou tolsawlou pawi lawm dingin mipi tampi Jerusalem ah apeikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amauten Jerusalem a maitamte ala doh ua, gimnamtui halna maitamte ahemkhe sieng ua, kidron luiguom ah apai siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aha ni na ni sawm leh ni li ni in peikan belam nou agou uhi. Siempute leh Levite azumta ua, akisiensuo ua, Mangpa biehinn ah halmang sillatte ahing tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian mi Mosi dan laibu akigiel bangin amun chiet uh aluota uhi; Siempute’n Levite khut akipat alah uh sisante athe uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen mipi kikhawmte lah a mi tampi kisiensuo lou a um uhi, tuaziehin Mangpa a dinga susiengthou dingin, asiengthou michin a dinga peikan gan gaw mawpuohna Levimiten atang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ephraim, Manasseh, Issakar leh Zebulun akipata hing pei mi tampi kisusienglou hinan u’leh zong, akigielsa dan lou bangtahin peikan ankuong ane veve uhi. Hinanleh Hezekiah in amaute athum pieh a, “Mangpa hoi in michin hing ngaidamta hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Munsiengthou dan a siengthoulou hinapi a, alungtang zousie utoh Mangpa apu apate uh Pasian sui mi pouma ngaidamta hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa’n Hezekiah thumna aza a mipite adam sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem a um Israel miten tanghou tolsawlou pawi ni sagi sung kipahtahin amang ua, tua hun sung tengin Levite leh siempute’n ni chin in, Mangpa kunga tumging toh la sain Mangpa aphat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hezekiah in Mangpa nasep dan theisiem mama Levite kungah hanthawn na thute agen hi. Amauten tua pawi kibawl ni sagi sung lemna sillatte lan in; Mangpa apu leh pate uh Pasian kungah kipah thu gen kawm in apahtawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mipi kikhawmte zousie in, ni sagi dang peikan pawi belap dingin akithukim ua, tuachi’n ni sagi dang kipahtah in azang nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lengpa Hezekiah in mipi kikhawmte a dingin, bawngtal tul khat leh belam leh kel tul sagi apie a, milienten bawngtal tul khat leh belam leh kel tul sawm apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Juda kikhawmpite abawn un siempute leh Levite tualeh Israel akipat a hing kikhawmpite leh Israel gam a kipat a hing peite leh Juda gam a teng gamdang mite toh akipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel leengpa David tapa Solomon hun akipat Jerusalem a tambanga kipahna Jerusalem ah aumkha ngai nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempute leh Levi mite adingdoh ua, mipite a guolzawlta uhi; tualeh athumnate uh Atenna mun siengthou van a atun tou ziehin Pasian in aza hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam peikan pawi ahing bei tahin, tua mun a um Israelte, Juda khopite ah ahaw ua, suonga kibawl milimte asat guoi ua, Ashera sawl khuomte aphua uhi. Juda leh Benjamin gam leh Ephraim leh Manasseh gam sunga, munsangte leh maitamte aphietmang uhi. Tuate zousie asuh siet sieng nua un Israelte amauh khopite leh ama-uh gam ah akinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekiah in siempute leh Levite apawl pawla kikhente kungah, michin anasep dan dungzui chiet un, siempute leh Levite halmang sillatte leh, lemna sillatte lan ding leh Mangpa tenna kotpite a nasem ding leh kipah thugen na leh phatna lasadingin aguot chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lengpa’n ama neisa akipat in, zingmawng leh nitahlam a halmang sillat ding leh khawlni a halmang sillat ding leh ha tha nite leh Mangpa danbu akigiel hunbi nei pawite adingin atan ding uh aguot pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman siempute leh Levite, Mangpa dan toh kisai a akipumpieh theina dingun ama uh tanvoute pie un, chiin leengpa’n Jerusalem a tengte kungah thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabang thupieh a um tahin Israelten aga masate uh, bute, zute, sathaute, khuoizute leh alou ua pieng gamasate ahing tawi ua, tualeh sil zousie a kipat sawm-a khat tampi ahing pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Juda khopite ateng Israel mite leh Juda miten zong aganhonte u’leh abelamhonte ua kipat sawma khat tualeh, Mangpa a Pasian ua dinga sillat siengthoute apat in sawm a khat ahing tawi ua, a sekhawm ua, avum venvon mai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aha thumna a akoi khawm pat uh ahia, aha sagi na ah azou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hezekiah leh amiliente ahing pei ua, tua sil kisievumte amu tah un, Mangpa aphat ua, ami Israelte aguolzawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah in tua sil kisievumte tungtang siempute leh Levimite adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zadok innkuon a siempu lienpen Azariah in adawnga, akungah, “Mipiten athawlawmte uh Mangpa biehinn a, ahing tawi lut kalsie uh, neh leh tah kiching ka nei ua, aval zong aum nalai hi; aziehpen Mangpa’n amite aguolzawl a, tamzapi val nalai seusou ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah in, Mangpa biehinn sunga vankoina pindante bawl ding thu apie a, akibawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n gin umtah in athawlawmte uh, sawma khatte leh latsa silpiehte ahing polut uhi. Tam silte tungah Levi mi Konaniah enkoltu lamkai ahi a, tualeh a unaupa Shimei ama zom in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lengpa Hezekiah leh Pasian biehinn toh kisai a mawpuo milien Azariah in aguot, Konaniah leh asanggampa Shimei nuoi ah, Jehiel, Azaziah, Nahath, Asahel, Neromoth, Jozabad, Eliel, Ismakiah, Mahath leh Beraiah te nasep enkaitu in apang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh suolam kotpi vengpa Levimi Imnah tapa Kore khu Pasian kunga, kiphalna silpiehte kemtu leh Mangpa kunga silpieh kipete leh sil siengthou pente, hawmtu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama nuoi ah Eden, Miniamin, Jeshua, Shemaiah, Amariah leh amauh nasep hun bang zel a aunaute alien aneu kunga apawl pawla gin umtah a tan hawmtute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuate ban ah, khangthu gellutna laibute a, min kikhumte pasal kum thum akipat atunglam, amawpuohnate uh dungzui a, ni chin a, nasep ding poimaw nei a, apawldan dung zui ua, Mangpa biehinn a kuon zelte kungah zong ahawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khangthu gellutna a, innkuon kuon a minkhum siempute kungah ahawm ua, Levite kum sawmni apat atunglamte kungah zong amawpuohna dung zui u’leh apawl pawla kikhenna bangun, ahawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam khangthu gelna laibute a, minkhumte zousie lah ah azite uh, atapate u’leh atanute uh zong atel hi, Amaute pen ginumtah a kisiensuote ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khopi kim a lougam a teng, ahisihleh khopi dangte a teng Aaron hahlesuon siempute lah a pasalte leh Levite khangthu gelna laibu a, min khumte lah a atanvou uh hawm dingin, amin min a kilou in mi aguot uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hichibangin Hezekiah in Juda gam pumpi ah, Mangpa a Pasian mai ah sil hoi leh dih tualeh gin umna silte abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangpa biehinn a nasep silbawlna zousie leh danthu leh thupiehte zuina ah, Hezekiah in a Pasian maipha asui a, alungtang zousie toh asem a, alawching zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekia in muonhuoitah a abawl sieng nua in, Asiria leengpa Sennakerib ahing kuon a, Juda gam ahing lut a, khopi kulpi neite ama a dinga lah sawm in khopite kimkot ah abulu theina dingin panmun akhaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sennakerib Jerusalem dou dingin ahing kuon chi Hezekiah in amu tah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amiliente leh galkap lamkaite toh khopi pulam a tuinahte akipat tuite khahbing ding thu akikum ua, tuachi’n amaun apanpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi tampi akikhawm ua, gamsunga tuinahte leh luitate akhahbingta uhi. “Ama un bang dinga Asiria leengpa hing pei a, tui tampi mu ding ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh ama akisuhata kulbang sietnate zousie asiemtha a, atungah innsangte alam hi. Kulbang umsa pulam ah kulbang dang alamthuo a, tua ban ah David khopi lei kisesangna mun luite abawl pha a, galvan leh lum tampi abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman mipite tungah galkap lamkaite akoi a, khopi kotkhah bul a mun awng ah ama kungah amaute apuikhawm a, akung uah, hanthawn thu tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hattah leh hangsan tahin um un, Asiria leengpa leh akunga um galkap hon tampite zieh in zau sih unlen, lungke vawt sih un, aziehpen ama lam a pang sangin eilam a pang atam zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama kunga um pen mihing banthahatna ahi a, hinanleh eite hing umpi a hing panpi ding leh igalte hing doupi dinga ikung ua um khu Mangpa i Pasian uh ahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n mipite khu Juda leengpa Hezekiah thugen in, akingam sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum nua in Asiria leengpa Sennakerib leh agalkap honte zousie in Lakish abulu laitah un, Sennakerib in Juda leengpa leh Jerusalem a um Juda mite zousie kungah, amiliente asawl a, akung uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Asiria leengpa Sennakerib in tambangin agen hi: Koi muonga Jerusalem lah ding gingta lou a um nalai na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hezekiah in, Asiria leengpa khut akipat in “Mangpa i Pasian in hing hundoh nava achi laiin, gilkiel leh dangta a shi dinga hing kimuongkhiel sah ahi bou hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam Hezekiah mama in, amunsangte leh amaitamte phietmangin, Juda leh Jerusalem a tengte kung ah, “Maitam khat mai ah Pasian na be ding ua, atungah gimnamtui na hal ding uh ahi, chi’n thu ahing pie hilou amah?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei leh ka pu leh paten gamdang mite zousie tunga bang ahiei ka bawl uh, theilou na hi uoi mah? khum gam a namte pasien ten ka khuta pat in amauh ahunkhe thei ngel uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pu leh paten ana suhmang siengsa namte, pasiente lah ah koi ahiei, ka khut a kipata amite a hunkhe thei ngai ei, noute Pasian in zong ka khut akipat nou ahing hunkhe zou tuom ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin Hezekiah in hing solbawl sih henlen, tam bangin hing sol lungdam sih heh, tualeh ama zong gingta sih un, aziehpen koima nam pasien leh koima leenggam pasien in ka khut apat leh ka pu leh pate khut akipat amite ahunkhe zou ngai sih uhi. Noute pasien in ka khut apat ahing hunkhe tuom dieh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sennakerib milienten Mangpa Pasian leh asuohpa Hezekiah demsietna thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman Mangpa Israelte Pasian gensietna leh demna dingin laihah agiel nalai a, “Gamdang leh nam dangte pasien in ka khut apat ahuhdoh theilou mabang un, Hezekiah Pasian in zong ka khut a kipat amite ahundoh zou tuom sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun khopi alah theina ding ua, suh zau na ding leh asuh chizat theina dingun, kul bang tunga um Jerusalem mite kungah Juda ham in aw ngaitahin agal hat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaun leitunga midangte pasiente, mihing khut suoh leltahte agen siet bangun, Jerusalem Pasian a gensie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin leengpa Hezekiah leh Amoz tapa guolnei Isai athum ua, vanlam ngain akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n vansawlsieng khat asawl a, Aman Asiria leengpa giehphuol a galkapte leh lamkaite, tualeh miliente abawn un athatgam sieng hi. Tuachi’n Sennakerib maizum tahin agam langah akinuale kiata hi. Tualeh apasien biehinn sunga ahing lut laitah in, ama tapate mama in namsau in asunlumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Hezekiah leh Jerusalem mite, Asiria leengpa Sennakerib khut akipat in leh midang zousiete khut a kipat in ahunkheta hi. Tuachi’n Aman lamchinteng ah amaute akhotuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi tampiten Jerusalem ah Mangpa a dingin silpiehte ahingtawi ua, tualeh Juda leengpa Hezekiah adingin zong kipahmante ahing tawi uhi. Tua hun a kipat in nam zousie mitmu ah tawisangin aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum hun lai in Hezekiah ahing china a, shi dingkhopin aum hi; tuachi’n Mangpa kungah athum a Aman adawnga, akungah chiemtena lamdang khat apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Hezekiah lungtang akisathei a, atunga deisahna kibawlpen sil hoi bawlin athuh sih hi. Tuaziehin Mangpa thangpaina khu ama tung leh Juda leh Jerusalem tungah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuabepin Hezekiah alungtang kisahtheina apat kisia in akingaingiem a, Jerusalem mite zong akisia uhi. Tuaziehin Mangpa thangpaina Hezekiah damsungin amaute tangah atungta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hezekiah in hausatna leh zatatna thupitah atang a, sana, dangka leh suongmantamte, gimnamtuite leh lumte leh sil manpha namkim koina ding goukholna innte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bu leh bal leh uoin thate leh sathaute koina ding innte zong abawl a, ganta chituom tuom a dingin buhte alam pieh a, belam honte adingin huongte abawl pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aman khotate abawla, ganhon tampi leh kel leh belam hon tampite anei hi. Pasian in hausatna thupi mama apieh zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tam Hezekiah mama ahi Gihon tuinah pawtna sahta zaw hubinga David khopi tumlam panga leinuoi a tui zawla luong sahpa. Anasepna pouma ah alawching hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh gamsunga sil lamdang kibawlte kankhe dinga Babilon vaihawm lienten patongte asawl tah un, Pasian in ama ze et ding leh alungtang a um zousie theina dingin ama apat akihemkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hezekiah vaihawm sunga siltung dangte leh anasep hoi zousiete, Amoz tapa guolnei Isai laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hezekiah apulepate kungah a imuta a, David hahlesuonte han sahta zaw ah akivuita hi. Ama a shi tah in, Juda mi zousie leh Jerusalem mi zousie in thupi tahin agaal uhi. Tuachi’n ama thahengin atapa Manasseh leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawm leh ni a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmnga leh nga sung vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh aman, Mangpa’n Israelte mai a anawdoh namte kidahhuoina zui in, Mangpa mitmu ah sil dihlou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman apa Hezekiah in aphietmangsa, munsangte alamtha kia a, Baal maitamte zong atungding kia a, Ashera songlaite zong aphut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mangpa’n Jerusalem ah ka min kumtawn in aum ding” achina mun Mangpa biehinn sungah aman maitamte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh aman Mangpa biehinn huongsung leituol tegel ah van a um aasi honte a dingin maitamte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ben-Hinnom guom ah atapate mei ah haltum in alan a, tualeh dawi ai san siemte aguoi a, bum siemte azanga, hagau bua neite leh mitphieldawi siemte zong thu adong hi; Mangpa suthangpai dingin amitmu ah silgilou tampi abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasian in David leh atapa Solomon kunga, “Israel mamte zousie mai a ka na telsa tami biehinn sung leh Jerusalem ah ka min kumtawn in ka koi ding hi, chia ana genna Pasian biehinn sungah leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosi zanga ka thupieh dan thute leh thuguotte leh thugousiete dungzui a bawl dinga, apilvang u’leh, apu leh pate uh kana piehsa gam akipat in, Israelte keng ka suondoh nawn sih ding, achina mun ah, aman ama bawlthu milim khenthu khat atungdoh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Manasseh in Judate leh Jerusalem mite apuimanga, Mangpa’n Israelte mai a asuhmang namte sangin zong atatse zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n Manasseh leh amite kungah, thu agen a, hinanleh amaun angaikhe ngaisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n Asiria galkap lamkaite amauh dou dingin ahing kuon sah a, amauten Manasseh aman ua, kol abun sah ua, anahkuo ah siakuol avaw ua, sum-eng kol in akan ua, Babilon gam ah azawpita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Alungkham mangbat laitah in Mangpa a Pasian deisahna asui a, apu apate Pasian mai ah nasatah in akingaingiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama kunga athum tahin, athumna in Mangpa lung akhoi a, angetna angaikhie a, Jerusalem leh a leenggam ah atut kiata hi. Tuachi’n Manasseh in Pasian ahoi hi, chi atheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khum nuain aman Gihon luinah guom tumlam a David khopi kulbang pawnungzaw, Nga kotpi lutna dong, Ophel muol imkuol in asiempha a; asang zaw sem in abawl hi. Aman Juda gamsunga khopi kulpi nei zousie ah galkap lamkaite akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gamdang pasiente leh Mangpa biehinn sunga milimte leh Mangpa biehinn muol tunga amaitam bawlte zousie, tualeh Jerusalem kholai a maitamte zong aladoh a, khopi pulam ah apaimang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Mangpa maitam abawltha kia a, atungah lemna sillatte leh kipah thugenna sillatte alan hi; tualeh Mangpa Israel Pasian nna a sem a, Ama be dingin Juda mite thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh mipite munsangte ah akithoi zing nalai lai ua, ahivangin tuate Mangpa a Pasian uh kung bou a alat uh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manasseh vaihawm sunga siltungte, a Pasian kung a athumna leh guolneiten Mangpa Israel Pasian mina ama kunga athunget utoh, Israel leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Athumna leh Pasian hepina amu dante, akingaingiem masanga agitlounate leh amuonhuoi lounate leh munsang abawlnate leh Ashera sawlkhuom aphunate leh milim khenthu atundohnate thute abawnin guolneite laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Manasseh apu apate kungah a imuta a, ama innpi ah akivuita hi. Ama thahengin atapa Amon leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amon leenga ahing pan chiillai in, kum sawmni leh kum ni a upa ahia, Jerusalem ah kumni sung vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Apa Manasseh bangin Mangpa mitmu ah silgilou abawl hi. Amon in apa Manasseh in ana bawlsa milimte zousie kungah kithoina abawl a, tua milimte abie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh apa Manasseh kingai ngiem bangin Mangpa mai ah akingaingiem sih a, Amon atakhiel deu deu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amon amilienten aguhin aphiel ua, aleeng innpi sungah athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh agamsung miten leengpa Amon tunga thu phielgu zousie athat sieng ua, agam mipiten atapa Josiah ama thahengin leeng in apang sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah leenga apan chiil lai in kum giet a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawm thum leh kum khat vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman Mangpa mitmu in sildih abawl a, apu David lampite azui a, veilam ahiei, zietlam ahiei, ah zong apielsan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Avaihawm kum gietna ah, naupang ahi lai in, apu David Pasian sui apanta a, kum sawm leh ni na ah Juda leh Jerusalem akipat munsangte Ashera sawlkhuomte, milim kikhenthute leh milim kisunthawte, aphietmang panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama thupiehna nuoi ah, Baal maitamte asatchim ua, atung ua um gimnamtui halna maitamte asat guoi ua, Ashera sawlkhuomte, milim khenthute leh milim kisunthawte, asatguoi sieng hi. Tam banga asatguoina neente u’khu, tam milimte kunga kithoite, hantung ah athe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman siempute gu te amaitamte u’tungah ahal a, tambangin Juda leh Jerusalem asusiengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachibang main, Manasseh, Ephraim, Simeon leh Naphtali donga khopite leh akimvela um khopineute abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh maitamte leh Ashera sawl khuomte asat pua a, milimte agawt guoi a, tualeh Israel gamsung pumpi a, gimnamtui halna maitamte asat guoi sienga, Tuachi’n Jerusalem ah akinuale kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josiah vaihawm akum sawm leh gietna ah gamsung leh biehinn asuhsieng zou in, Azaliah tapa Shaphan leh khopi vaihawmpa Maaseiah tualeh laigielpa Joahaz tapa Joah te, Mangpa a Pasian biehinn bawlpha dingin asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaute siempulien Hilkiah kungah ava haw ua, Pasian biehinn a hing kitawi sumte apie uhi. Tua sumte pen kotpi veng Levite, Manassehte, Ephraim mite leh Israel mi umsunte, tualeh Juda leh Benjamin mite zousie leh Jerusalem a tengte zousie apat adon khieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amauten Mangpa bieh inn bawl, nasemte enkai dinga kiguot mite khut ah akem sah uhi. Tam miten biehinn siempha nasem mite kungah anasep thaman un apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaun, sing nasemte leh inn lam mite kungah zong, suongkhensa leh inn zawlnuoinung pen leh inn kam ding zawl liente leina ding sum apie uhi. Tuabang vante pen Juda leengte’n keplou donlou a ana koi uh innte lamtha kia nading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Miten gin umtahin nna asem ua, amaute tungah nasep dan enkai dingin Merari hahlesuon, Levimite Johath leh Obadiah, tualeh Kohath hahle suon Levi mite Zekariah leh Meshullam, apang uhi. Tumging tum siem Levi mite pen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />nna semte tunga vaihawm in apang ua, tualeh nna sepna tuom tuom a, nasemte a enkai uhi. Tualeh Levi mi lawikhatte pen laigiel mite leh Uliente leh kotpi vengin apang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa biehinn sunga kikoilut sumte ahing lahdoh lai un siempu Hilkiah in, Mosi tungtawn a kipie Mangpa Dan laibu amukhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hilkiah in laigielpa Shaphan kungah, “Mangpa biehinn sungah, Dan laibu ka mukheta hi” achi a, Shaphan kungah apekheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Shaphan in tua Dan laibu khu leengpa kungah ava tawi a, akungah, “Na u lienten amauh sep dinga kipete zousie asem uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaun Mangpa biehinn a sum kimu zousie alakhawm ua, Nasep enkhe mite khut leh nasem mite khut ah akem sah zel uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n laigielpa Shaphan in leengpa kungah, “Siempu Hilkiah in laibu khat kei ahing pie hi,” achi a, leengpa mai ah tua laibu asimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lengpa’n tua Dan thute azah tahin, apuonsilte abotkeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lengpa’n Hilkiah leh Shaphan tapa Ahikam leh Mikah tapa Abdon leh laigielpa Shaphan leh leengpa suohpa Asaiah thu apie a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Pei unlen, kei a ding leh Israel leh Juda kinuasie umsunte adingin tam laibu kimudoh sunga kigiel thute tungtang toh kisai in Mangpa hing doh pieh un; Ipu Ipaten Mangpa thu amanlou zieh ua, Mangpa lungthahna eite tunga kisung buo, athupi sengta hi, aziehpen amaute tam laibu sunga kigiel banga na gamtalou uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hilkiah leh ama toh zawhkhawm dinga leengpa misawlte guolneinu Huldah houpi dingin akuon uhi. Huldah pen Shalum zi ahia, Shalum khu Tokhath tapa ahi a, Tokhath khu Hasrah tapa ahi a, Hasrah pen puonsilte kempa ahi. Huldah khu Jerusalem vengtha lam a teng ahi. Amanu kungah khum thute ava genta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amanu’n akung uah, “Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi. Ka kunga noute hing sawlpa kungah na gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa’n agen hi. Ngai un, keiman tam mun leh asunga teng zousiete tungah sietna ka hing tung sah ding hi; Juda leengpa mai a asim uh, tua laibu sunga kigiel hamsie zousiete tungsah ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen kei ahing taisan ua, pasien dangte mai a gimnamtui ahal ua, amauh khuta abawlthu zousiete uh zanga ahing lungthah sah zieh un, ka lungthahna tam mun tungah sunbuoh in a um dinga, kiphelmit zoulou ding ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mangpa thu dong dinga noute hing sawlpa Juda leengpa tung thu ahileh, tambangin akungah na gen un, Israelte Mangpa Pasian in, na thuzahte tung tangah tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na lungtangin thu na ngaikhe nuom a, tam mun leh asunga tengte zousie sietna ding thu kigen na zah laitah a, Pasian mai a, na kingaingiem a, na puonte na botkeh a, ka mai a na kaa ziehin, Ken zong ka hing ngaikheta hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuin Na pu leh pate kungah ka hing pui dinga, Hamuong tah in na kivui dinga, tam mun leh asunga tengte tunga ka tunsah ding sietna, na mitin amu sih ding hi,” achi hi, achi hi. Tuachi’n Huldah dawnna leengpa kungah atut kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Juda leh Jerusalem upate ahankhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa khu, Juda mite, Jerusalem mite, siempute leh Levi mite toh, aneupen akipat alienpen dongin Mi zousie toh, Mangpa biehinn ah apeitou uhi. Aman, amaute zah in, tua Mangpa biehinn a kimukhie, thuhun laibu a thute zousie asim khie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lengpa ama mun ah adinga, tam laibu a kigiel thuhun thute bawltha kia dinga, alungtang zousie leh ahinna zousie toh Mangpa zui ding leh athupiehte, adanthupiehte, athugousiete leh athu theisahte, zui dingin Mangpa mai ah thu ahung tha kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem leh Benjamin gam a mi zousie tam thuhun zui dingin akichiem sah a, Jerusalem miten Pasian apu apate uh Pasian thuhun dungzui in abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Josiah in Israelte gamsung pumpi akipat in milim kidahhuoi zousie aphietmanga, Israel gam a um mi zousieten Mangpa a Pasian uh nna asem sahta hi. Tualeh Josiah damsung tengin, amauten apu apate uh Pasian tawp sanlou in azui uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah in Jerusalem ah Mangpa dingin Peikan pawi abawl a, aha khatna ni sawm leh li niin, peikan belam nou agou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman siempute kungah, anasep ding uh aguotpieh chiet hi. Mangpa biehinn a, nasem dingin ahantawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite zousie thuhilte, Mangpa adinga kisiensuo, Levimite kungah, “Israelte leengpa David tapa Solomon in alam biehinn sungah bawm siengthou koilut un; tam pen na liengkou ua mun tuom tuom a puoh ding ahi nawn sih hi. Tuin Mangpa na Pasian u’leh ami Israelte na sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel leengpa David leh atapa Solomon thupieh kigiel dungzuiin, na pu leh pate uh innkuon kikhen dung zui in, apawl pawl in kisakhol un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipi vantang na gammi hipite uh, apawl pawl a kikhente dinga kiguot Levite pawl khat chiet toh mun siengthou ah ding khawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n peikan belamnoute gou u’len, kisiensuo unlen, Mangpa’n Mosi zanga thu apieh dungzui in, na chi na namte uh kimansa in umsah un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josiah in mipi nautang um zousie dinga, peikan sillat dingin belam leh kel tul sawm thum leh bawngtal tul thum mipite kungah apie hi, tamte khu leengpa neisa apat ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josiah u lienten zong amauh kiphalna in mipite leh siempute tualeh Levite dingin atuoh uhi. Pasian biehinn vaisai lien, Hilkiah, Zekariah leh Jehiel in siempute kungah peikan sillat dingin belamnou leh kelnou tul ni leh za guh leh bawngtal zathum apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Konaniah leh asanggamte Shemaiah leh Nathaneel in zong, tualeh Levite lamkaite Hashabiah, Jeiel leh Zozabad ten zong Peikan sillat dingin belamnou leh kelnou tul nga leh bawngtal za nga Levite kungah apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peikan nasepna dingte bawl tup diem ahitah in, leengpa thupieh dungzui in siempute amauh mun chiet ah ading ua, Levite zong apawl kikhen dan dungzui un ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peikan belamnou a gou ua, siempute’n amauh kunga kipie sisante athe ua, avunte pen Leviten alem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosi dan laibu a kigiel mipite a innkuon kikhen dan dungzui ua Mangpa kunga lat ding apieh theina dingun, halmang sillatte akoituom zel uhi. Tuabangma in bawngtalte zong abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amauten thugousie dungzui in Peikan belamnou khu mei in a em min ua; sillat siengthoute pen belpum te, belpite leh khangbelte in ahuon ua, mipite kungah kintah in aluikhe pai pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuazou in amauleh siempute dingin neh ding abawl uhi. Aaron hahlesuon siempute pen halmang sillat leh sathaute lan a zan donga buoi ahi zieh un, Leviten ama ua ding leh Aaron tapa siempute a ding in neh ding abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asaph hahlesuon lasa mite, khu David leh Asaph leh Heman tualeh leengpa guolnei Jeduthun thupieh dungzui in amauh mun chiet ah aum uhi. Kotpi vengte zong akotpi venna mun chiet uah aum uhi, a Levipi aunaute un amaute neh ding abawl pieh zieh un, anasepna mun uh ataisan uh akuul sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Josiah thupieh bangin, Peikan pawi mang ding leh, Mangpa maitam tunga halmang sillat dingin, Mangpa nasepna zousie, tua ni ma in bawlzou diem ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua mun a um Israelte zousiein tuami hun in peikan pawi abawl ua, tualeh tanghou tolsawlou pawi ni sagi abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Guolnei Samuel hunlai a kipat in Israelte lah ah tambangin peikan pawi aki bawl khanai sih hi, tualeh Israel leengte zousie leh siempute, Levimite leh tua mun a um Juda mite leh Israel mi zousie leh Jerusalem a, tengte’n zong Josiah bawl banga peikan pawi a bawlkha ngainai mawngmawng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Josiah avaihawm kum sawm leh gietna kum in tami peikan pawi akibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tamte zousie nua in, Josiah in biehinn abawl tha zou tahin, Izipt leengpa Neko in Euphrates luipi panga um Karkemish dou dingin akuontou a: Josiah zong ama dou dingin akuondoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Neko in Josiah kungah patong asawl a, akung ah, “Nang leh Kei kidouna ding bang thu a um ei mah? aw Nang Juda leengpa? Tuni’n nangma dou dinga hing kuon ka hisih a, ka kidoupisa innkuonte dou dinga hing kuon ka hibou hi. Pasian in kintah a kuon dingin ahing hil ahi, tuaziehin kei hing umpi Pasian in ahing suhmang louna dingin hing kikum da maiin,” ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Josiah in ama akiheisan nuom sih a hinanleh ama akidoupi theina dingin akisiem lamdanga, Pasian thupieh a Neko thugente asang nuom sih a, tuachi’n Megiddo phaijang ah kidou dingin akuon suhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thalkap miten leengpa Josiah akapkha ua, tuachi’n leengpa’n a Uliente kungah, “Hing peimangpi ta un, ka liem nah sengta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n a Ulienten a sakolleng akipat alakhie ua, ama sakolleeng nina pen ah akoi ua, Jerusalem ahing tut ua, khunah ashita hi. Apu apate han khuh ah aki vui a, Juda leh Jerusalem mite zousie in ama a suun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jeremiah in zong Josiah kala toh akaa a, tualeh pasal lasamite leh numei lasamite zousie in tuni dongin aka chiengun Josiah min aloukha nalai ua, Tam pen Israel gam ah chin dan ngaina khat a hing suohta a, kalate sungah tam late aki giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josiah vaihawm sunga siltung dangte leh Mangpa dan sunga kigiel dungzui a, ginumtaha anasep hoite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tualeh anasepna zousie abul akipat atawp dong Ngai vawi, Israel leengte khangthu kigelna laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua gam miten Josiah tapa Jehoahaz azawpi ua, apa thahengin Jerusalem ah leeng in apang sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoahaz leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawmni leh kum thum a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah hathum vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Izipt leengpa’n Jerusalem ah aleeng hina asuhbei pieh a, Juda gam akipat dangka sum talent zakhat leh sana talent khat sie lieu dingin akoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izipt leengpa’n Jehoahaz sanggam Eliakim Juda leh Jerusalem tunga leengpa in apang sah a, amin Jehoiakim in ahen pieh hi, tualeh Neko in asanggampa Jehoahaz aman a Izipt ah azawpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakim leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawmni leh kum nga a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh khat vai ahawm hi. Aman Mangpa a Pasian mitmu in silgilou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama dou dingin Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar ahing kuontou a, Babilon lam ah sal a pui dingin sum-eng kol abun sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar in Mangpa biehinn akipat in vanzah tui um belsuonte ala a, Babilon a ama pasien biehinn ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakim vaihawm sunga siltung dangte sil kidahhuoi abawlte leh ama umdan zousie, ngai in, Israel leh Juda leengte khangthu gelna laibu sungah aki giel hi. Ama thahengin atapa Jehoiakin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiakin leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawm leh giet a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah hathum leh ni sawm sung vai ahawm hi. Aman zong Mangpa mitmuin silgilou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum hing kihei a, khawkhal hun lai in leengpa Nebukadnezzar in mi asawl a, ama leh Mangpa biehinn a van manpha bel leh kuongte toh Babilon ah apui a, asanggampa Zedekiah Juda leh Jerusalem tunga leeng in apang sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zedekiah leenga apan chiil lai in kum sawmni leh kum khat ahia, Jerusalem ah kum sawm le khat vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman Mangpa a Pasian mitmu in silgilou abawl a, Mangpa kam a kipata thugenpa Jeremiah mai ah akingiemkhieh ut sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasian min a kichiemsahpa leengpa Nebukadnezzar tungah zong ahel a, angawng avaipuoh a, Mangpa Israelte Pasian langa kinuahei nuomlou in alungtang akhau sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuathamlouin siempu lamkaite zousie leh mipiten nam dangte gamtatna kidahhuoite zuiin, agin um maw semsem uhi; tuachi’n Mangpa’n asiensuosa Jerusalem a Mangpa biehinn abua sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa apu apate uh Pasian in amite leh atenna mun alainat seng ziehin, amaute kungah thangkoute asawl sawnsawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun Pasian thupotute ana nuisat ua, athugente uh ana thusim pieh sih ua, amipite tunga Mangpa thangpaina atun masangsie leh athoidam kia nading aumlou nuasang dongin zong aguolneite a enghou nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuazieh in aman Kaldai mite leengpa amauh dou dingin ahing puitou a, aman atangvalte uh amunsiengthou ah athat a, tangval hiin, nungah hitaleh tehsete leh mizawngkhalte hitaleh hepina bei in namsau in athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman Pasian biehinn a vanzah um leh belte zousie alien hiin aneu hitaleh, tualeh Mangpa bieh inn a goute leh leengpa leh a vaihawm liente inn a goute zousie Babilon ah apomang siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaun Pasian biehinn ahal ua, Jerusalem kulbangte asatchim ua, asunga leengpa innpite zousie mei in ahaltum ua, tualeh van manpha zousie asusie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Namsau akipat a suohta sunsunte, Babilon langah apuimanga, Persia leenggam hing kitunding tan dong in, leengpa leh atapate suoh leh sal in apang denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jeremiah kam a nakigen Mangpa thute atangtun na dingin kum sawm sagi abei masangsie’n tua gam in khawlni amang denta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Persia leengpa Sairas vaihawm akum khatna ah Jeremiah kam zanga Mangpa’n agen thute atangtun theina dingin, Mangpa’n Persia leengpa Sairas lungtang atohthou a, tuachi’n aleeng gam pumpi ah thuphuon abawla, tua khu agelkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tami Persia leengpa Sairas thugen ahi, Aman Mangpa van Pasian in leitung leeng gam zousie kei ahing pie a, Juda gam a um Jerusalem ah ama ading biehinn bawl pieh dingin ahing guotta hi. Noute lah a ama mite koi ahiei kuon ding? Mangpa a Pasian in umpi henlen, kuon heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
